window.IELTS_TOPIC={"topic":5,"en":"Psychology: Stress, Motivation & Decision-Making","zh":"心理學：壓力、動機與決策","items":[{"w":"pressure","pos":"n.","def":"a feeling of worry caused by too much to do","cn":"壓力","s":"Many senior high students feel a lot of ________ before the entrance exam, so teachers try to keep the classroom calm and friendly.","zh":"許多高三學生在升學考試前感受到很大的壓力,所以老師們試著讓教室保持平靜和友善。","part":"A","sec":"Stress & the Body 壓力與身體反應","lab":"A1","t":"壓力"},{"w":"strain","pos":"n.","def":"a difficult situation that makes you tired or worried","cn":"負擔;壓力","s":"Looking after her sick father and working full-time put a huge ________ on Amy, and she started to lose sleep.","zh":"照顧生病的父親又要全職工作,給艾咪帶來了巨大的負擔,她開始失眠。","part":"A","sec":"Stress & the Body 壓力與身體反應","lab":"A2","t":"負擔"},{"w":"adrenaline","pos":"n.","def":"a body chemical that gives energy when you are scared or excited","cn":"腎上腺素","s":"When the fire alarm suddenly rang, a rush of ________ made my heart race, and I ran down the stairs very quickly.","zh":"火災警報突然響起時,一股腎上腺素讓我心跳加速,我很快地跑下樓梯。","part":"A","sec":"Stress & the Body 壓力與身體反應","lab":"A3","t":"腎上腺素"},{"w":"heartbeat","pos":"n.","def":"the sound or movement of your heart","cn":"心跳","s":"I could hear my own ________ in my ears as I walked onto the stage, but I took a slow breath and began my speech.","zh":"走上舞台時,我在耳朵裡能聽見自己的心跳,但我慢慢吸了一口氣,然後開始演講。","part":"A","sec":"Stress & the Body 壓力與身體反應","lab":"A4","t":"心跳"},{"w":"pulse","pos":"n.","def":"how fast your heart is beating, felt at the wrist","cn":"脈搏","s":"The nurse checked my ________ after the long run, and she said it was still high because my body was under stress.","zh":"長跑之後護士檢查了我的脈搏,她說脈搏還是很快,因為我的身體正處於壓力之下。","part":"A","sec":"Stress & the Body 壓力與身體反應","lab":"A5","t":"脈搏"},{"w":"sweat","pos":"v.","def":"to have water come out of your skin","cn":"流汗","s":"Ben always starts to ________ when he has to speak English in front of the class, so he keeps a small towel in his bag.","zh":"班每次要在全班面前說英文時就開始流汗,所以他在書包裡放了一條小毛巾。","part":"A","sec":"Stress & the Body 壓力與身體反應","lab":"A6","t":"流汗"},{"w":"tremble","pos":"v.","def":"to shake slightly because you are afraid or nervous","cn":"顫抖","s":"My hands began to ________ when I opened the envelope with my test results, but I was relieved to see a good score.","zh":"我打開裝著考試成績的信封時,雙手開始顫抖,但看到好成績我就鬆了一口氣。","part":"A","sec":"Stress & the Body 壓力與身體反應","lab":"A7","t":"顫抖"},{"w":"panic","pos":"v.","def":"to suddenly feel so afraid that you cannot think clearly","cn":"驚慌","s":"Don't ________ if you cannot answer the first question, because you can skip it and come back to it later.","zh":"如果第一題答不出來,不要驚慌,因為你可以先跳過,之後再回來作答。","part":"A","sec":"Stress & the Body 壓力與身體反應","lab":"A8","t":"驚慌"},{"w":"nervous","pos":"adj.","def":"worried and a little afraid about something","cn":"緊張的","s":"Lisa felt very ________ before her job interview, so she practised her answers with her sister the night before.","zh":"麗莎在工作面試前感到非常緊張,所以她前一天晚上和姊姊一起練習回答問題。","part":"A","sec":"Stress & the Body 壓力與身體反應","lab":"A9","t":"緊張"},{"w":"tense","pos":"adj.","def":"unable to relax because you are worried","cn":"緊繃的","s":"The atmosphere in the office was ________ before the big meeting, and nobody wanted to tell jokes or chat.","zh":"大會議開始前,辦公室裡的氣氛很緊繃,沒有人想說笑或閒聊。","part":"A","sec":"Stress & the Body 壓力與身體反應","lab":"A10","t":"緊繃"},{"w":"headache","pos":"n.","def":"a pain in your head","cn":"頭痛","s":"I often get a bad ________ when I stay up late studying, so I now try to go to bed before midnight.","zh":"我熬夜讀書時常常會頭痛,所以現在我試著在午夜前上床睡覺。","part":"A","sec":"Stress & the Body 壓力與身體反應","lab":"A11","t":"頭痛"},{"w":"exhaustion","pos":"n.","def":"the state of being extremely tired","cn":"筋疲力盡","s":"After three nights of little sleep, Tom was suffering from ________, and his doctor told him to rest for a few days.","zh":"連續三晚睡得很少之後,湯姆陷入筋疲力盡的狀態,醫生要他休息幾天。","part":"A","sec":"Stress & the Body 壓力與身體反應","lab":"A12","t":"筋疲力盡"},{"w":"overwork","pos":"v.","def":"to work too hard or too long","cn":"過度工作","s":"If you ________ every day without a break, your body will eventually get sick, and your work will not improve either.","zh":"如果你每天都過度工作而不休息,身體最後會生病,你的工作表現也不會變好。","part":"A","sec":"Stress & the Body 壓力與身體反應","lab":"A13","t":"過度工作"},{"w":"deadline","pos":"n.","def":"the latest time by which something must be finished","cn":"截止期限","s":"The ________ for the science report is next Monday, but Kevin has not even started his research yet.","zh":"科學報告的截止期限是下週一,但凱文連研究都還沒開始。","part":"A","sec":"Stress & the Body 壓力與身體反應","lab":"A14","t":"截止期限"},{"w":"workload","pos":"n.","def":"the amount of work a person has to do","cn":"工作量","s":"Our teacher reduced the homework ________ during exam week, because she knew we were already very stressed.","zh":"考試週期間老師減少了作業的工作量,因為她知道我們已經壓力很大了。","part":"A","sec":"Stress & the Body 壓力與身體反應","lab":"A15","t":"工作量"},{"w":"stressor","pos":"n.","def":"something that causes stress","cn":"壓力源","s":"Moving to a new school is a common ________ for teenagers, but making one good friend can make the change much easier.","zh":"轉學到新學校是青少年常見的壓力源,但交到一個好朋友就能讓這個改變輕鬆許多。","part":"A","sec":"Stress & the Body 壓力與身體反應","lab":"A16","t":"壓力源"},{"w":"fight-or-flight","pos":"adj.","def":"describing the body's quick reaction to danger","cn":"戰或逃(反應)的","s":"When a dog suddenly barked at me, my ________ response kicked in, and I jumped back before I could even think.","zh":"一隻狗突然對我吠叫時,我的戰或逃反應啟動了,我還來不及思考就往後跳開。","part":"A","sec":"Stress & the Body 壓力與身體反應","lab":"A17","t":"戰或逃"},{"w":"immune system","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the parts of the body that fight illness","cn":"免疫系統","s":"Long periods of stress can weaken your ______ ______, so you may catch colds more easily during busy exam seasons.","zh":"長期的壓力會削弱你的免疫系統,所以在忙碌的考試季節你可能更容易感冒。","part":"A","sec":"Stress & the Body 壓力與身體反應","lab":"A18","t":"免疫系統"},{"w":"restless","pos":"adj.","def":"unable to stay still or relax","cn":"焦躁不安的","s":"The children grew ________ after sitting in the car for four hours, so their parents stopped at a park to let them run.","zh":"孩子們在車上坐了四個小時後變得焦躁不安,所以父母在一座公園停車讓他們跑一跑。","part":"A","sec":"Stress & the Body 壓力與身體反應","lab":"A19","t":"焦躁不安"},{"w":"jittery","pos":"adj.","def":"nervous and shaky","cn":"緊張不安的","s":"I drank too much coffee before the test, and I felt ________ for the whole morning, so now I only drink water.","zh":"考試前我喝了太多咖啡,整個早上都覺得緊張不安,所以現在我只喝水。","part":"A","sec":"Stress & the Body 壓力與身體反應","lab":"A20","t":"緊張不安"},{"w":"sleepless","pos":"adj.","def":"without sleep","cn":"失眠的;無眠的","s":"Emma spent a ________ night worrying about her presentation, but in the end the audience loved her ideas.","zh":"艾瑪為了她的簡報擔心了一整個無眠的夜晚,但最後聽眾很喜歡她的想法。","part":"A","sec":"Stress & the Body 壓力與身體反應","lab":"A21","t":"無眠"},{"w":"migraine","pos":"n.","def":"a very bad headache that can make you feel sick","cn":"偏頭痛","s":"My mother gets a ________ when she is under a lot of pressure at work, and she has to lie down in a dark room.","zh":"我媽媽工作壓力很大時會偏頭痛,她必須躺在黑暗的房間裡休息。","part":"A","sec":"Stress & the Body 壓力與身體反應","lab":"A22","t":"偏頭痛"},{"w":"blood pressure","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the force of blood moving through your body","cn":"血壓","s":"The doctor said my grandfather's ______ ______ was too high, so he should reduce stress and eat less salt.","zh":"醫生說我爺爺的血壓太高,所以他應該減少壓力並少吃鹽。","part":"A","sec":"Stress & the Body 壓力與身體反應","lab":"A23","t":"血壓"},{"w":"stomachache","pos":"n.","def":"a pain in your stomach","cn":"胃痛;肚子痛","s":"Some students get a ________ on the morning of a big test, although they are not really sick.","zh":"有些學生在大考當天早上會肚子痛,雖然他們並沒有真的生病。","part":"A","sec":"Stress & the Body 壓力與身體反應","lab":"A24","t":"肚子痛"},{"w":"appetite","pos":"n.","def":"the feeling that you want to eat","cn":"食慾","s":"Jason lost his ________ during the stressful week of finals, and his mother worried because he barely ate dinner.","zh":"傑森在期末考那個壓力很大的一週失去了食慾,他媽媽很擔心,因為他幾乎不吃晚餐。","part":"A","sec":"Stress & the Body 壓力與身體反應","lab":"A25","t":"食慾"},{"w":"breathe","pos":"v.","def":"to take air into your body and let it out","cn":"呼吸","s":"The coach told the players to ________ slowly before the penalty kick, and it helped them stay calm and focused.","zh":"教練告訴球員們在罰球前要慢慢呼吸,這幫助他們保持冷靜和專注。","part":"A","sec":"Stress & the Body 壓力與身體反應","lab":"A26","t":"呼吸"},{"w":"frazzled","pos":"adj.","def":"very tired and upset because of too much to do","cn":"疲憊不堪的","s":"By Friday afternoon, the new teacher felt completely ________, but a quiet weekend helped her recover.","zh":"到了星期五下午,這位新老師覺得完全疲憊不堪,但一個安靜的週末幫助她恢復了精神。","part":"A","sec":"Stress & the Body 壓力與身體反應","lab":"A27","t":"疲憊不堪"},{"w":"hectic","pos":"adj.","def":"very busy and full of activity","cn":"忙亂的","s":"December is always a ________ month for shop workers, so many of them feel tired and stressed before the holidays.","zh":"十二月對店員來說總是忙亂的月份,所以許多人在假期前感到疲累和有壓力。","part":"A","sec":"Stress & the Body 壓力與身體反應","lab":"A28","t":"忙亂"},{"w":"demanding","pos":"adj.","def":"needing a lot of time, effort or skill","cn":"要求高的;費力的","s":"Nursing is a very ________ job, but many nurses say that helping patients makes all the hard work worthwhile.","zh":"護理是一份非常費力的工作,但許多護理師說幫助病人讓所有的辛苦都很值得。","part":"A","sec":"Stress & the Body 壓力與身體反應","lab":"A29","t":"費力"},{"w":"overthinking","pos":"n.","def":"thinking about something too much, in a way that is not helpful","cn":"想太多;過度思考","s":"Too much ________ kept Mia awake at night, so her counsellor suggested writing her worries on paper before bed.","zh":"過度思考讓米亞晚上睡不著,所以她的輔導老師建議她睡前把煩惱寫在紙上。","part":"A","sec":"Stress & the Body 壓力與身體反應","lab":"A30","t":"過度思考"},{"w":"emotion","pos":"n.","def":"a strong feeling such as love, fear or anger","cn":"情緒;情感","s":"It is normal to feel a mix of ________ before graduation, because you are excited about the future but sad to leave your friends.","zh":"畢業前感受到複雜的情緒是正常的,因為你對未來感到興奮,卻又捨不得離開朋友。","part":"A","sec":"Emotions & Mental Health 情緒與心理健康","lab":"A31","t":"情緒"},{"w":"frustration","pos":"n.","def":"the feeling of being upset because you cannot do something","cn":"挫折感","s":"Leo shouted in ________ when his computer crashed again, and he lost the essay he had been writing all evening.","zh":"里歐的電腦又當機時,他挫折地大叫,而且他弄丟了整個晚上都在寫的文章。","part":"A","sec":"Emotions & Mental Health 情緒與心理健康","lab":"A32","t":"挫折"},{"w":"anger","pos":"n.","def":"a strong feeling when something is wrong or unfair","cn":"憤怒","s":"Instead of showing her ________ in front of the class, the teacher waited until she was calm and then spoke to the student.","zh":"老師沒有在全班面前表現她的憤怒,而是等到自己冷靜下來才和那位學生談話。","part":"A","sec":"Emotions & Mental Health 情緒與心理健康","lab":"A33","t":"憤怒"},{"w":"fear","pos":"n.","def":"the feeling you have when you think something bad will happen","cn":"恐懼","s":"Many people have a ________ of speaking in public, but regular practice can make it much less frightening.","zh":"許多人對公開演講有恐懼,但經常練習可以讓它變得不那麼可怕。","part":"A","sec":"Emotions & Mental Health 情緒與心理健康","lab":"A34","t":"恐懼"},{"w":"worry","pos":"v.","def":"to keep thinking about problems or bad things","cn":"擔心","s":"Parents often ________ about their children's grades, but too much pressure from home can make students even more stressed.","zh":"父母常常擔心孩子的成績,但來自家裡的太多壓力會讓學生壓力更大。","part":"A","sec":"Emotions & Mental Health 情緒與心理健康","lab":"A35","t":"擔心"},{"w":"guilt","pos":"n.","def":"a bad feeling because you did something wrong","cn":"罪惡感","s":"Sam felt a strong sense of ________ after he forgot his best friend's birthday, so he bought her a gift the next day.","zh":"山姆忘了最好朋友的生日之後感到強烈的罪惡感,所以他隔天買了一份禮物給她。","part":"A","sec":"Emotions & Mental Health 情緒與心理健康","lab":"A36","t":"罪惡感"},{"w":"shame","pos":"n.","def":"a painful feeling that you have done something wrong or silly","cn":"羞愧","s":"He felt deep ________ after cheating on the quiz, and he finally told his teacher the truth.","zh":"他在小考作弊後感到深深的羞愧,最後他向老師說出了實話。","part":"A","sec":"Emotions & Mental Health 情緒與心理健康","lab":"A37","t":"羞愧"},{"w":"embarrassment","pos":"n.","def":"the feeling of being shy or uncomfortable in front of others","cn":"尷尬","s":"Her face turned red with ________ when she called her teacher \"Mum\" by mistake, but everyone laughed kindly.","zh":"她不小心把老師叫成「媽媽」時,臉因為尷尬而漲紅,但大家都善意地笑了。","part":"A","sec":"Emotions & Mental Health 情緒與心理健康","lab":"A38","t":"尷尬"},{"w":"jealousy","pos":"n.","def":"an unhappy feeling when someone has what you want","cn":"嫉妒","s":"A little ________ is natural when your friend wins a prize, but it should not stop you from congratulating her.","zh":"朋友得獎時有一點嫉妒是很自然的,但這不應該阻止你恭喜她。","part":"A","sec":"Emotions & Mental Health 情緒與心理健康","lab":"A39","t":"嫉妒"},{"w":"envy","pos":"v.","def":"to want something that another person has","cn":"羨慕","s":"I sometimes ________ students who never seem nervous before exams, but I know they probably work hard too.","zh":"我有時會羨慕那些考試前似乎從不緊張的同學,但我知道他們可能也很努力。","part":"A","sec":"Emotions & Mental Health 情緒與心理健康","lab":"A40","t":"羨慕"},{"w":"grief","pos":"n.","def":"great sadness, especially when someone dies","cn":"悲痛","s":"After his grandmother died, Ken was full of ________, so his friends visited him often and listened to his stories about her.","zh":"奶奶過世後,肯滿懷悲痛,所以他的朋友們常去探望他,並聽他講關於奶奶的故事。","part":"A","sec":"Emotions & Mental Health 情緒與心理健康","lab":"A41","t":"悲痛"},{"w":"relief","pos":"n.","def":"a happy feeling when something worrying ends","cn":"鬆了一口氣;寬慰","s":"It was a great ________ to hear that the flight was safe, because we had been waiting at the airport for hours.","zh":"聽到班機平安讓我們鬆了一口氣,因為我們已經在機場等了好幾個小時。","part":"A","sec":"Emotions & Mental Health 情緒與心理健康","lab":"A42","t":"鬆了一口氣"},{"w":"contentment","pos":"n.","def":"a quiet feeling of being happy and satisfied","cn":"滿足","s":"My grandfather finds ________ in simple things, such as gardening and drinking tea with his old friends.","zh":"我爺爺在簡單的事情中找到滿足,像是種花種菜和跟老朋友喝茶。","part":"A","sec":"Emotions & Mental Health 情緒與心理健康","lab":"A43","t":"滿足"},{"w":"satisfaction","pos":"n.","def":"a pleased feeling after you do or get what you wanted","cn":"滿意;滿足感","s":"Finishing a difficult puzzle gives me a sense of ________, and it also helps me forget about my worries.","zh":"完成一個困難的拼圖帶給我一種滿足感,也能幫助我忘掉煩惱。","part":"A","sec":"Emotions & Mental Health 情緒與心理健康","lab":"A44","t":"滿足感"},{"w":"optimism","pos":"n.","def":"the feeling that good things will happen","cn":"樂觀","s":"Her ________ helped the whole team, because she always believed they could win even when they were behind.","zh":"她的樂觀幫助了整個團隊,因為即使落後,她也總是相信他們能贏。","part":"A","sec":"Emotions & Mental Health 情緒與心理健康","lab":"A45","t":"樂觀"},{"w":"pessimism","pos":"n.","def":"the feeling that bad things will happen","cn":"悲觀","s":"There was a lot of ________ among the players after three losses, but the coach reminded them of their past successes.","zh":"輸了三場之後,球員之間瀰漫著悲觀的氣氛,但教練提醒他們過去的成功。","part":"A","sec":"Emotions & Mental Health 情緒與心理健康","lab":"A46","t":"悲觀"},{"w":"optimistic","pos":"adj.","def":"hopeful that things will turn out well","cn":"樂觀的","s":"Although the test was hard, Jenny felt ________ about her score, because she had studied every chapter carefully.","zh":"雖然考試很難,珍妮對她的分數感到樂觀,因為她仔細讀過了每一章。","part":"A","sec":"Emotions & Mental Health 情緒與心理健康","lab":"A47","t":"樂觀"},{"w":"pessimistic","pos":"adj.","def":"expecting things to go badly","cn":"悲觀的","s":"My brother is always ________ about job interviews, so I tell him to focus on his strengths instead.","zh":"我哥哥對工作面試總是很悲觀,所以我叫他改為專注於自己的優點。","part":"A","sec":"Emotions & Mental Health 情緒與心理健康","lab":"A48","t":"悲觀"},{"w":"gloomy","pos":"adj.","def":"sad and without hope","cn":"憂鬱的;陰沉的","s":"The rainy weather made everyone feel ________, so our teacher played some cheerful music during the break.","zh":"下雨的天氣讓大家都覺得陰沉憂鬱,所以老師在下課時播放了一些輕快的音樂。","part":"A","sec":"Emotions & Mental Health 情緒與心理健康","lab":"A49","t":"陰沉憂鬱"},{"w":"cheerful","pos":"adj.","def":"happy and friendly","cn":"開朗的;愉快的","s":"The nurse was always ________ with her patients, and her smile made the hospital feel less frightening.","zh":"那位護理師對病人總是很開朗,她的微笑讓醫院顯得不那麼可怕。","part":"A","sec":"Emotions & Mental Health 情緒與心理健康","lab":"A50","t":"開朗"},{"w":"calm","pos":"adj.","def":"relaxed and not worried or excited","cn":"冷靜的;平靜的","s":"Try to stay ________ during the exam, because panicking will only make you forget what you have learned.","zh":"考試時要盡量保持冷靜,因為驚慌只會讓你忘記學過的東西。","part":"A","sec":"Emotions & Mental Health 情緒與心理健康","lab":"A51","t":"冷靜"},{"w":"upset","pos":"adj.","def":"unhappy or worried because something bad happened","cn":"難過的;心煩的","s":"Lily was ________ when her best friend moved to another city, but they still video-chat every weekend.","zh":"莉莉最好的朋友搬到另一個城市時,她很難過,但她們每個週末仍然視訊聊天。","part":"A","sec":"Emotions & Mental Health 情緒與心理健康","lab":"A52","t":"難過"},{"w":"annoyed","pos":"adj.","def":"a little angry","cn":"惱怒的;不耐煩的","s":"I was ________ when my little brother kept talking during my online class, so I asked him to play in another room.","zh":"我上線上課時弟弟一直講話,讓我很惱怒,所以我請他去別的房間玩。","part":"A","sec":"Emotions & Mental Health 情緒與心理健康","lab":"A53","t":"惱怒"},{"w":"phobia","pos":"n.","def":"a very strong fear of something","cn":"恐懼症","s":"Mark has a ________ of heights, so he never goes on the glass bridge, even when his friends try to persuade him.","zh":"馬克有懼高恐懼症,所以即使朋友試著說服他,他也從不走玻璃橋。","part":"A","sec":"Emotions & Mental Health 情緒與心理健康","lab":"A54","t":"恐懼症"},{"w":"counsellor","pos":"n.","def":"a person trained to listen and give advice about problems","cn":"輔導員;諮商師","s":"If you feel stressed about school, you can talk to the school ________, and everything you say will be kept private.","zh":"如果你對學業感到有壓力,可以找學校的輔導老師談談,你說的一切都會被保密。","part":"A","sec":"Emotions & Mental Health 情緒與心理健康","lab":"A55","t":"輔導老師"},{"w":"therapist","pos":"n.","def":"a person who helps people with mental or physical problems","cn":"治療師","s":"After the car accident, Anna saw a ________ every week, and slowly she felt brave enough to drive again.","zh":"車禍之後,安娜每週去看治療師,慢慢地她覺得有勇氣再開車了。","part":"A","sec":"Emotions & Mental Health 情緒與心理健康","lab":"A56","t":"治療師"},{"w":"therapy","pos":"n.","def":"treatment that helps someone feel better","cn":"治療","s":"Talking ________ helped my cousin understand his feelings, and now he handles stress much better than before.","zh":"談話治療幫助我表哥了解自己的感受,現在他處理壓力的能力比以前好多了。","part":"A","sec":"Emotions & Mental Health 情緒與心理健康","lab":"A57","t":"治療"},{"w":"psychologist","pos":"n.","def":"a person who studies the mind and behaviour","cn":"心理學家;心理師","s":"The ________ explained that short breaks help the brain rest, so students should not study for hours without stopping.","zh":"那位心理學家解釋說,短暫的休息能讓大腦休息,所以學生不應該連續讀好幾個小時都不停下來。","part":"A","sec":"Emotions & Mental Health 情緒與心理健康","lab":"A58","t":"心理學家"},{"w":"psychiatrist","pos":"n.","def":"a doctor who treats mental illness","cn":"精神科醫師","s":"Her family doctor sent her to a ________, because her sleeping problems had lasted for many months.","zh":"她的家庭醫師把她轉介給精神科醫師,因為她的睡眠問題已經持續好幾個月了。","part":"A","sec":"Emotions & Mental Health 情緒與心理健康","lab":"A59","t":"精神科醫師"},{"w":"self-confidence","pos":"n.","def":"belief in your own abilities","cn":"自信心","s":"Joining the drama club gave Tina more ________, and now she is not afraid to share her ideas in class.","zh":"加入戲劇社讓蒂娜更有自信心,現在她不再害怕在課堂上分享想法。","part":"A","sec":"Emotions & Mental Health 情緒與心理健康","lab":"A60","t":"自信心"},{"w":"relaxation","pos":"n.","def":"the act of resting and becoming calm","cn":"放鬆","s":"Listening to soft music is my favourite form of ________, and it helps me fall asleep after a long day at school.","zh":"聽輕音樂是我最喜歡的放鬆方式,它幫助我在學校忙碌一整天後入睡。","part":"A","sec":"Coping & Self-Care 調適與自我照顧","lab":"A61","t":"放鬆"},{"w":"meditation","pos":"n.","def":"sitting quietly and focusing your mind to feel calm","cn":"冥想","s":"Our class tried ten minutes of ________ before the test, and many students said they felt less nervous afterwards.","zh":"我們班在考試前嘗試了十分鐘的冥想,許多同學說之後覺得比較不緊張了。","part":"A","sec":"Coping & Self-Care 調適與自我照顧","lab":"A62","t":"冥想"},{"w":"yoga","pos":"n.","def":"exercises for the body and breathing that help you relax","cn":"瑜伽","s":"My aunt started doing ________ twice a week, and she says her back pain and stress have both improved.","zh":"我阿姨開始每週做兩次瑜伽,她說她的背痛和壓力都改善了。","part":"A","sec":"Coping & Self-Care 調適與自我照顧","lab":"A63","t":"瑜伽"},{"w":"journaling","pos":"n.","def":"writing about your thoughts and feelings regularly","cn":"寫日記;寫心情筆記","s":"Daily ________ helps Amy understand her feelings, because writing them down makes her problems seem smaller.","zh":"每天寫心情日記幫助艾咪了解自己的感受,因為把感受寫下來讓她的問題顯得比較小。","part":"A","sec":"Coping & Self-Care 調適與自我照顧","lab":"A64","t":"寫心情日記"},{"w":"hobby","pos":"n.","def":"an activity you enjoy in your free time","cn":"嗜好","s":"Painting is a relaxing ________ for my father, and he often paints on Sunday mornings to forget about work.","zh":"畫畫是我爸爸很放鬆的嗜好,他常在星期天早上畫畫來忘掉工作。","part":"A","sec":"Coping & Self-Care 調適與自我照顧","lab":"A65","t":"嗜好"},{"w":"workout","pos":"n.","def":"a session of physical exercise","cn":"運動;健身","s":"A short ________ after school gives me more energy, so I can concentrate better when I do my homework.","zh":"放學後短暫的運動給我更多精力,所以我寫作業時能更專心。","part":"A","sec":"Coping & Self-Care 調適與自我照顧","lab":"A66","t":"運動"},{"w":"nap","pos":"n.","def":"a short sleep during the day","cn":"小睡;午睡","s":"A twenty-minute ________ after lunch can refresh your brain, but sleeping too long may make you feel more tired.","zh":"午餐後二十分鐘的小睡可以讓大腦恢復精神,但睡太久可能會讓你更累。","part":"A","sec":"Coping & Self-Care 調適與自我照顧","lab":"A67","t":"小睡"},{"w":"deep breathing","pos":"n.phr.","def":"taking slow, full breaths to calm down","cn":"深呼吸","s":"The nurse taught the children ______ ______ before their injections, and most of them stayed calm and did not cry.","zh":"護理師在打針前教孩子們深呼吸,大部分的孩子都保持冷靜沒有哭。","part":"A","sec":"Coping & Self-Care 調適與自我照顧","lab":"A68","t":"深呼吸"},{"w":"self-care","pos":"n.","def":"things you do to protect your own health and happiness","cn":"自我照顧","s":"Getting enough sleep is an important part of ________, but many busy students ignore it during exam week.","zh":"睡眠充足是自我照顧的重要部分,但許多忙碌的學生在考試週會忽略它。","part":"A","sec":"Coping & Self-Care 調適與自我照顧","lab":"A69","t":"自我照顧"},{"w":"gratitude","pos":"n.","def":"the feeling of being thankful","cn":"感恩;感激","s":"Writing down three things you feel ________ for each night can make you happier, and it only takes two minutes.","zh":"每天晚上寫下三件讓你心懷感恩的事可以讓你更快樂,而且只需要兩分鐘。","part":"A","sec":"Coping & Self-Care 調適與自我照顧","lab":"A70","t":"感恩"},{"w":"positivity","pos":"n.","def":"a hopeful and cheerful attitude","cn":"正面態度;正能量","s":"Our coach is full of ________, so even after a loss, the team leaves practice feeling hopeful.","zh":"我們的教練充滿正能量,所以即使輸了比賽,球隊練習結束時仍然充滿希望。","part":"A","sec":"Coping & Self-Care 調適與自我照顧","lab":"A71","t":"正能量"},{"w":"unwind / unwound / unwound","pos":"v.","def":"to relax after work or stress","cn":"放鬆","s":"After a busy week, my parents like to ________ by watching a movie at home, and they turn off their phones.","zh":"忙碌一週之後,我爸媽喜歡在家看電影來放鬆,而且他們會把手機關掉。","part":"A","sec":"Coping & Self-Care 調適與自我照顧","lab":"A72","t":"放鬆"},{"w":"recharge","pos":"v.","def":"to get your energy back by resting","cn":"恢復精力;充電","s":"Weekend trips to the countryside help me ________, so I feel fresh and ready when Monday comes.","zh":"週末到鄉下旅行幫助我恢復精力,所以星期一來臨時我感到神清氣爽、準備就緒。","part":"A","sec":"Coping & Self-Care 調適與自我照顧","lab":"A73","t":"恢復精力"},{"w":"vent","pos":"v.","def":"to express strong feelings, especially anger","cn":"發洩","s":"It is healthy to ________ your feelings to a trusted friend, but shouting at strangers online is not a good idea.","zh":"向信任的朋友發洩情緒是健康的,但在網路上對陌生人大吼並不是好主意。","part":"A","sec":"Coping & Self-Care 調適與自我照顧","lab":"A74","t":"發洩"},{"w":"confide","pos":"v.","def":"to tell someone a secret or private feeling","cn":"吐露;傾訴","s":"Many teenagers ________ in their friends rather than their parents, because they worry that adults will not understand.","zh":"許多青少年會向朋友而不是父母傾訴,因為他們擔心大人不會理解。","part":"A","sec":"Coping & Self-Care 調適與自我照顧","lab":"A75","t":"傾訴"},{"w":"reassure","pos":"v.","def":"to make someone feel less worried","cn":"使安心","s":"The doctor ________ my mother that the operation was simple, and she finally stopped worrying.","zh":"醫生向我媽媽保證手術很簡單,讓她安心,她終於不再擔心了。","part":"A","sec":"Coping & Self-Care 調適與自我照顧","lab":"A76","t":"安心"},{"w":"comfort","pos":"v.","def":"to make someone feel better when they are sad","cn":"安慰","s":"When Sarah failed her driving test, her friends ________ her with ice cream and funny stories.","zh":"莎拉駕照考試沒過時,她的朋友們用冰淇淋和好笑的故事安慰她。","part":"A","sec":"Coping & Self-Care 調適與自我照顧","lab":"A77","t":"安慰"},{"w":"soothe","pos":"v.","def":"to make someone calm or less upset","cn":"撫慰;使平靜","s":"The sound of the rain ________ me, and I soon forgot about the argument I had with my brother.","zh":"雨聲撫慰了我,我很快就忘了和哥哥的爭吵。","part":"A","sec":"Coping & Self-Care 調適與自我照顧","lab":"A78","t":"撫慰"},{"w":"downtime","pos":"n.","def":"time when you rest and do not work","cn":"休息時間;空閒時間","s":"Students need some ________ every day, because studying all the time can lead to stress and poor sleep.","zh":"學生每天都需要一些休息時間,因為一直讀書會導致壓力和睡不好。","part":"A","sec":"Coping & Self-Care 調適與自我照顧","lab":"A79","t":"休息時間"},{"w":"getaway","pos":"n.","def":"a short holiday away from home","cn":"短暫度假","s":"After the busy exam period, our family took a weekend ________ to the beach, and we all came back relaxed.","zh":"忙碌的考試期過後,我們家去海邊短暫度假了一個週末,大家回來時都很放鬆。","part":"A","sec":"Coping & Self-Care 調適與自我照顧","lab":"A80","t":"短暫度假"},{"w":"laughter","pos":"n.","def":"the sound or act of laughing","cn":"笑聲;歡笑","s":"They say ________ is the best medicine, and watching a funny show with friends really does lower my stress.","zh":"人家說歡笑是最好的良藥,而和朋友一起看搞笑節目真的能降低我的壓力。","part":"A","sec":"Coping & Self-Care 調適與自我照顧","lab":"A81","t":"歡笑"},{"w":"socialise","pos":"v.","def":"to spend time with other people for fun","cn":"社交;與人交往","s":"Busy students should still ________ with friends sometimes, because spending time with people they like reduces stress.","zh":"忙碌的學生偶爾還是應該和朋友交際往來,因為和喜歡的人相處能減輕壓力。","part":"A","sec":"Coping & Self-Care 調適與自我照顧","lab":"A82","t":"交際往來"},{"w":"outlet","pos":"n.","def":"a way to express feelings or use energy","cn":"發洩管道;出口","s":"Playing the drums is a great ________ for my anger, and my neighbours are kind enough not to complain.","zh":"打鼓是我宣洩怒氣很好的出口,而且我的鄰居們很好心沒有抱怨。","part":"A","sec":"Coping & Self-Care 調適與自我照顧","lab":"A83","t":"出口"},{"w":"massage","pos":"n.","def":"rubbing the body to relieve pain or stress","cn":"按摩","s":"My shoulders were stiff after hours at the computer, so my sister gave me a short ________, and I felt much better.","zh":"在電腦前好幾個小時之後我的肩膀很僵硬,所以姊姊幫我做了簡短的按摩,我感覺好多了。","part":"A","sec":"Coping & Self-Care 調適與自我照顧","lab":"A84","t":"按摩"},{"w":"helpline","pos":"n.","def":"a phone service that gives advice or support","cn":"求助專線","s":"If you feel very upset late at night, you can call a ________, and a trained person will listen to you.","zh":"如果你深夜感到非常難過,可以打求助專線,會有受過訓練的人聽你說話。","part":"A","sec":"Coping & Self-Care 調適與自我照顧","lab":"A85","t":"求助專線"},{"w":"goal","pos":"n.","def":"something you want to achieve","cn":"目標","s":"My ________ this year is to read twenty English books, so I read for half an hour every night before bed.","zh":"我今年的目標是讀二十本英文書,所以我每晚睡前閱讀半小時。","part":"A","sec":"Motivation & Goals 動機與目標","lab":"A86","t":"目標"},{"w":"ambition","pos":"n.","def":"a strong wish to be successful","cn":"抱負;雄心","s":"Her ________ is to become a doctor, but she knows she must study very hard to reach that dream.","zh":"她的抱負是成為醫生,但她知道必須非常努力讀書才能實現那個夢想。","part":"A","sec":"Motivation & Goals 動機與目標","lab":"A87","t":"抱負"},{"w":"drive","pos":"n.","def":"strong energy and wish to achieve something","cn":"幹勁;動力","s":"Jack has the ________ to succeed, so he practises the piano every day even when his friends go out to play.","zh":"傑克有成功的幹勁,所以即使朋友們出去玩,他還是每天練琴。","part":"A","sec":"Motivation & Goals 動機與目標","lab":"A88","t":"幹勁"},{"w":"determination","pos":"n.","def":"not giving up even when something is difficult","cn":"決心","s":"With great ________, the runner finished the marathon, although she had hurt her ankle halfway through the race.","zh":"這位跑者憑著極大的決心跑完了馬拉松,雖然她在比賽途中扭傷了腳踝。","part":"A","sec":"Motivation & Goals 動機與目標","lab":"A89","t":"決心"},{"w":"perseverance","pos":"n.","def":"continuing to try even when progress is slow","cn":"毅力;堅持不懈","s":"Learning a language takes ________, because you will make many mistakes before you speak it well.","zh":"學習語言需要毅力,因為在說得流利之前你會犯很多錯。","part":"A","sec":"Motivation & Goals 動機與目標","lab":"A90","t":"毅力"},{"w":"willpower","pos":"n.","def":"the ability to control what you do and resist temptation","cn":"意志力","s":"It takes ________ to put your phone away while studying, but your grades will thank you later.","zh":"讀書時把手機收起來需要意志力,但你的成績之後會感謝你。","part":"A","sec":"Motivation & Goals 動機與目標","lab":"A91","t":"意志力"},{"w":"self-discipline","pos":"n.","def":"the ability to make yourself do things you should do","cn":"自律","s":"Online learning requires a lot of ________, because nobody checks whether you are really watching the lessons.","zh":"線上學習需要很強的自律,因為沒有人會檢查你是否真的在看課程。","part":"A","sec":"Motivation & Goals 動機與目標","lab":"A92","t":"自律"},{"w":"passion","pos":"n.","def":"a very strong interest or love for something","cn":"熱情;熱愛","s":"Daniel has a ________ for cooking, and he dreams of opening his own small restaurant one day.","zh":"丹尼爾對烹飪充滿熱情,他夢想有一天開一家屬於自己的小餐廳。","part":"A","sec":"Motivation & Goals 動機與目標","lab":"A93","t":"熱情"},{"w":"enthusiasm","pos":"n.","def":"a feeling of being very excited and interested","cn":"熱忱;熱衷","s":"The students showed great ________ for the science fair, so they stayed after school to build their projects.","zh":"學生們對科展展現極大的熱忱,所以他們放學後留下來製作作品。","part":"A","sec":"Motivation & Goals 動機與目標","lab":"A94","t":"熱忱"},{"w":"effort","pos":"n.","def":"the hard work you use to do something","cn":"努力","s":"Our teacher praises ________ more than results, because she believes hard work matters more than talent.","zh":"我們老師稱讚努力多過稱讚結果,因為她相信努力比天分更重要。","part":"A","sec":"Motivation & Goals 動機與目標","lab":"A95","t":"努力"},{"w":"achievement","pos":"n.","def":"something good you have done through hard work","cn":"成就","s":"Passing the advanced English test was a big ________ for Kelly, and her parents took her out to celebrate.","zh":"通過高級英語檢定對凱莉來說是很大的成就,她爸媽帶她出去慶祝。","part":"A","sec":"Motivation & Goals 動機與目標","lab":"A96","t":"成就"},{"w":"purpose","pos":"n.","def":"a reason that gives your life or work meaning","cn":"目的;意義","s":"Volunteering at the animal shelter gave Tom a sense of ________, and he stopped feeling bored on weekends.","zh":"在動物收容所當志工讓湯姆有了意義感,他週末不再覺得無聊。","part":"A","sec":"Motivation & Goals 動機與目標","lab":"A97","t":"意義感"},{"w":"curiosity","pos":"n.","def":"a strong wish to know or learn something","cn":"好奇心","s":"Young children are full of ________, and they ask \"why\" so many times that parents sometimes run out of answers.","zh":"小孩子充滿好奇心,他們問好多次「為什麼」,讓父母有時都答不出來了。","part":"A","sec":"Motivation & Goals 動機與目標","lab":"A98","t":"好奇心"},{"w":"inspiration","pos":"n.","def":"something that gives you new ideas or makes you want to do something","cn":"靈感;鼓舞","s":"The athlete's story was a great ________ to the students, and many of them joined the school running team.","zh":"那位運動員的故事對學生們是很大的鼓舞,許多人加入了學校的跑步隊。","part":"A","sec":"Motivation & Goals 動機與目標","lab":"A99","t":"鼓舞"},{"w":"praise","pos":"n.","def":"words that show you think someone did well","cn":"讚美;稱讚","s":"A little ________ from a teacher can make a big difference, because students work harder when they feel noticed.","zh":"老師的一點稱讚就能帶來很大的不同,因為學生覺得被注意到時會更努力。","part":"A","sec":"Motivation & Goals 動機與目標","lab":"A100","t":"稱讚"},{"w":"encouragement","pos":"n.","def":"words or actions that give someone confidence","cn":"鼓勵","s":"With her parents' ________, Grace entered the singing contest, and she was surprised to reach the final round.","zh":"在父母的鼓勵下,葛蕾絲參加了歌唱比賽,而她很驚訝自己進入了決賽。","part":"A","sec":"Motivation & Goals 動機與目標","lab":"A101","t":"鼓勵"},{"w":"grit","pos":"n.","def":"courage and the will to keep going","cn":"毅力;堅韌","s":"Research suggests that ________ matters as much as talent, because people who keep trying often achieve more.","zh":"研究顯示堅韌的毅力和天分一樣重要,因為持續嘗試的人往往成就更多。","part":"A","sec":"Motivation & Goals 動機與目標","lab":"A102","t":"堅韌的毅力"},{"w":"setback","pos":"n.","def":"a problem that delays your progress","cn":"挫折;阻礙","s":"Failing the first driving test was a ________, but Eric practised more and passed easily the second time.","zh":"第一次駕照考試沒過是個挫折,但艾瑞克多加練習,第二次就輕鬆通過了。","part":"A","sec":"Motivation & Goals 動機與目標","lab":"A103","t":"挫折"},{"w":"failure","pos":"n.","def":"a lack of success","cn":"失敗","s":"Don't see ________ as the end, because every mistake teaches you something useful for next time.","zh":"不要把失敗看作終點,因為每個錯誤都會教你一些下次有用的東西。","part":"A","sec":"Motivation & Goals 動機與目標","lab":"A104","t":"失敗"},{"w":"progress","pos":"n.","def":"movement towards a goal or improvement","cn":"進步;進展","s":"Keep a list of new words you learn each week, and you will see how much ________ you have made by the end of the term.","zh":"把每週學到的新單字列成清單,到學期末你就會看到自己有多大的進步。","part":"A","sec":"Motivation & Goals 動機與目標","lab":"A105","t":"進步"},{"w":"mindset","pos":"n.","def":"a person's usual way of thinking","cn":"心態;思維方式","s":"Students with a positive ________ see hard problems as chances to learn, while others may give up too quickly.","zh":"擁有正向心態的學生把難題看作學習的機會,而其他人可能太快放棄。","part":"A","sec":"Motivation & Goals 動機與目標","lab":"A106","t":"心態"},{"w":"self-belief","pos":"n.","def":"confidence in your own abilities","cn":"自信;相信自己","s":"Winning the speech contest gave Ivy more ________, and she began to answer questions in class without fear.","zh":"贏得演講比賽讓艾薇更相信自己,她開始毫不畏懼地在課堂上回答問題。","part":"A","sec":"Motivation & Goals 動機與目標","lab":"A107","t":"相信自己"},{"w":"competitive","pos":"adj.","def":"wanting very much to win or be better than others","cn":"好勝的;競爭的","s":"My brother is very ________, so he gets upset when he loses even a simple card game with the family.","zh":"我弟弟非常好勝,所以連跟家人玩簡單的紙牌遊戲輸了他都會不高興。","part":"A","sec":"Motivation & Goals 動機與目標","lab":"A108","t":"好勝"},{"w":"eager","pos":"adj.","def":"wanting to do something very much","cn":"渴望的;熱切的","s":"The new students were ________ to make friends, so they joined several clubs during the first week of school.","zh":"新生們渴望交朋友,所以他們在開學第一週就加入了好幾個社團。","part":"A","sec":"Motivation & Goals 動機與目標","lab":"A109","t":"渴望"},{"w":"keen","pos":"adj.","def":"very interested and enthusiastic","cn":"熱衷的;渴望的","s":"Tom is ________ on basketball, and he practises shooting every evening, even when it is cold outside.","zh":"湯姆熱衷於籃球,他每天傍晚都練習投籃,即使外面很冷也一樣。","part":"A","sec":"Motivation & Goals 動機與目標","lab":"A110","t":"熱衷"},{"w":"hardworking","pos":"adj.","def":"putting a lot of effort into work","cn":"勤奮的","s":"My classmate is so ________ that she reviews her notes on the bus, so she rarely needs to study late at night.","zh":"我的同學非常勤奮,她在公車上複習筆記,所以她很少需要熬夜讀書。","part":"A","sec":"Motivation & Goals 動機與目標","lab":"A111","t":"勤奮"},{"w":"lazy","pos":"adj.","def":"not wanting to work or make an effort","cn":"懶惰的","s":"I felt ________ on Sunday morning and stayed in bed, but then I had to rush to finish my homework at night.","zh":"星期天早上我覺得很懶,一直賴在床上,結果晚上必須趕著完成作業。","part":"A","sec":"Motivation & Goals 動機與目標","lab":"A112","t":"懶"},{"w":"boredom","pos":"n.","def":"the feeling of being tired because nothing is interesting","cn":"無聊;厭倦","s":"Some students check their phones out of ________, but this habit can make it hard to concentrate in class.","zh":"有些學生出於無聊而查看手機,但這個習慣會讓上課難以專心。","part":"A","sec":"Motivation & Goals 動機與目標","lab":"A113","t":"無聊"},{"w":"self-motivated","pos":"adj.","def":"able to work hard without others pushing you","cn":"自動自發的","s":"Ken is very ________, so he studies English online every day even though nobody tells him to.","zh":"肯非常自動自發,所以即使沒有人要求,他每天都在線上學英文。","part":"A","sec":"Motivation & Goals 動機與目標","lab":"A114","t":"自動自發"},{"w":"focus","pos":"v.","def":"to give all your attention to one thing","cn":"專注","s":"It is hard to ________ on your homework when the TV is on, so find a quiet place and turn off your phone.","zh":"電視開著的時候很難專注在作業上,所以找個安靜的地方並把手機關掉。","part":"A","sec":"Motivation & Goals 動機與目標","lab":"A115","t":"專注"},{"w":"procrastinate","pos":"v.","def":"to delay doing something you should do","cn":"拖延","s":"I often ________ when I have a big essay to write, so I now break it into small parts and do one each day.","zh":"我有一篇大論文要寫時常常會拖延,所以現在我把它分成小部分,每天完成一部分。","part":"A","sec":"Procrastination & Habits 拖延與習慣","lab":"A116","t":"拖延"},{"w":"procrastination","pos":"n.","def":"the habit of delaying things you should do","cn":"拖延(症)","s":"________ is a common problem among students, and it often leads to stress the night before a deadline.","zh":"拖延是學生常見的問題,它常常導致截止日前一晚壓力很大。","part":"A","sec":"Procrastination & Habits 拖延與習慣","lab":"A117","t":"拖延"},{"w":"postpone","pos":"v.","def":"to move an event to a later time","cn":"延期;延後","s":"The school decided to ________ the sports day because of the typhoon, and students were happy to have an extra week to practise.","zh":"學校因為颱風決定延後運動會,學生們很高興多了一週可以練習。","part":"A","sec":"Procrastination & Habits 拖延與習慣","lab":"A118","t":"延後"},{"w":"delay","pos":"v.","def":"to make something happen later than planned","cn":"延遲;耽擱","s":"If you ________ starting your project, you will have less time to fix mistakes, and the result may disappoint you.","zh":"如果你延遲開始你的專題,你修正錯誤的時間就會變少,結果可能讓你失望。","part":"A","sec":"Procrastination & Habits 拖延與習慣","lab":"A119","t":"延遲"},{"w":"habit","pos":"n.","def":"something you do regularly, often without thinking","cn":"習慣","s":"Checking her phone first thing in the morning became a bad ________, so Lucy now keeps it outside her bedroom.","zh":"一早醒來就查看手機成了一個壞習慣,所以露西現在把手機放在臥室外面。","part":"A","sec":"Procrastination & Habits 拖延與習慣","lab":"A120","t":"習慣"},{"w":"habitual","pos":"adj.","def":"done often or regularly as a habit","cn":"習慣性的","s":"He is a ________ late-comer, and his teacher finally called his parents because he missed the first class every Monday.","zh":"他是個習慣性遲到的人,老師最後打電話給他的父母,因為他每週一都錯過第一節課。","part":"A","sec":"Procrastination & Habits 拖延與習慣","lab":"A121","t":"習慣性"},{"w":"temptation","pos":"n.","def":"a strong wish to do something you should not do","cn":"誘惑","s":"The ________ to play games was strong, but Kevin finished his maths homework first and then relaxed.","zh":"打電動的誘惑很強,但凱文先完成數學作業,然後才放鬆。","part":"A","sec":"Procrastination & Habits 拖延與習慣","lab":"A122","t":"誘惑"},{"w":"tempt","pos":"v.","def":"to make someone want to do something, often something wrong","cn":"引誘;吸引","s":"The smell of fried chicken ________ me to stop at the night market, although I had promised to eat healthily this week.","zh":"炸雞的香味引誘我在夜市停下來,雖然我答應過這週要吃得健康。","part":"A","sec":"Procrastination & Habits 拖延與習慣","lab":"A123","t":"引誘"},{"w":"schedule","pos":"n.","def":"a plan that lists times for activities","cn":"時間表;行程","s":"Making a weekly study ________ helped me balance homework and basketball, and I felt much less stressed.","zh":"擬定每週讀書時間表幫助我平衡作業和籃球,我覺得壓力小了很多。","part":"A","sec":"Procrastination & Habits 拖延與習慣","lab":"A124","t":"時間表"},{"w":"timetable","pos":"n.","def":"a list of times when classes or events happen","cn":"課表;時刻表","s":"Our class ________ changed this term, so now we have English first thing on Monday, which everyone finds hard.","zh":"我們班這學期的課表改了,所以現在星期一第一節就是英文,大家都覺得很辛苦。","part":"A","sec":"Procrastination & Habits 拖延與習慣","lab":"A125","t":"課表"},{"w":"planner","pos":"n.","def":"a small book for writing plans and dates","cn":"計畫本;記事本","s":"I write all my tests and deadlines in a ________, and checking it every morning keeps me from forgetting anything.","zh":"我把所有的考試和截止日期寫在計畫本裡,每天早上查看它讓我不會忘記任何事。","part":"A","sec":"Procrastination & Habits 拖延與習慣","lab":"A126","t":"計畫本"},{"w":"to-do list","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a list of tasks you need to do","cn":"待辦清單","s":"I make a ______ ______ every Sunday night, and crossing off each finished task gives me a nice feeling.","zh":"我每個星期天晚上都會列一張待辦清單,每劃掉一項完成的事就讓我感覺很好。","part":"A","sec":"Procrastination & Habits 拖延與習慣","lab":"A127","t":"待辦清單"},{"w":"reminder","pos":"n.","def":"something that helps you remember","cn":"提醒(物)","s":"I set a phone ________ for my dentist appointment, because I had forgotten it twice before.","zh":"我在手機上設定了看牙醫的提醒,因為我之前已經忘記過兩次了。","part":"A","sec":"Procrastination & Habits 拖延與習慣","lab":"A128","t":"提醒"},{"w":"checklist","pos":"n.","def":"a list of things to check or do","cn":"檢查清單","s":"Before every trip, my mother uses a ________ to pack, so we never forget passports or phone chargers.","zh":"每次出遊前,我媽媽都用檢查清單打包,所以我們從不會忘記護照或手機充電器。","part":"A","sec":"Procrastination & Habits 拖延與習慣","lab":"A129","t":"檢查清單"},{"w":"avoidance","pos":"n.","def":"staying away from something you do not want to face","cn":"逃避;迴避","s":"Playing games all night was just ________, because Tim did not want to think about his poor test result.","zh":"整晚打電動只是一種逃避,因為提姆不想去想他很差的考試成績。","part":"A","sec":"Procrastination & Habits 拖延與習慣","lab":"A130","t":"逃避"},{"w":"excuse","pos":"n.","def":"a reason you give to explain a mistake or avoid something","cn":"藉口","s":"Andy always has an ________ for not doing his homework, but this time his teacher did not believe him.","zh":"安迪總是有不寫作業的藉口,但這次老師不相信他了。","part":"A","sec":"Procrastination & Habits 拖延與習慣","lab":"A131","t":"藉口"},{"w":"last-minute","pos":"adj.","def":"done at the latest possible time","cn":"最後一刻的;臨時的","s":"________ studying rarely works well, because your brain needs time and sleep to remember new information.","zh":"臨時抱佛腳的讀書很少有好效果,因為大腦需要時間和睡眠來記住新資訊。","part":"A","sec":"Procrastination & Habits 拖延與習慣","lab":"A132","t":"臨時抱佛腳"},{"w":"cram","pos":"v.","def":"to study a lot in a short time before an exam","cn":"臨時抱佛腳;死記硬背","s":"Many students ________ the night before a test, but they often forget most of the information a week later.","zh":"許多學生在考試前一晚死記硬背,但一週後他們往往忘了大部分的內容。","part":"A","sec":"Procrastination & Habits 拖延與習慣","lab":"A133","t":"死記硬背"},{"w":"self-control","pos":"n.","def":"the ability to control your feelings and actions","cn":"自制力","s":"It takes ________ to stop watching videos after one episode, so I ask my sister to hide the remote control.","zh":"看完一集影片就停下來需要自制力,所以我請姊姊把遙控器藏起來。","part":"A","sec":"Procrastination & Habits 拖延與習慣","lab":"A134","t":"自制力"},{"w":"streak","pos":"n.","def":"a series of successes or days in a row","cn":"連續紀錄","s":"I have a sixty-day ________ on my language app, and I don't want to lose it, so I practise even on holidays.","zh":"我在語言學習應用程式上有六十天的連續紀錄,我不想中斷,所以連假日也練習。","part":"A","sec":"Procrastination & Habits 拖延與習慣","lab":"A135","t":"連續紀錄"},{"w":"craving","pos":"n.","def":"a very strong wish for something, often food","cn":"渴望;癮","s":"Stress can give people a ________ for sweet snacks, so I keep fruit on my desk during exam week.","zh":"壓力會讓人渴望甜食,所以考試週時我在書桌上放水果。","part":"A","sec":"Procrastination & Habits 拖延與習慣","lab":"A136","t":"渴望"},{"w":"idle","pos":"adj.","def":"not working or doing anything useful","cn":"閒置的;無所事事的","s":"Rather than sitting ________ during the long summer holiday, Mia took a part-time job at a bookshop.","zh":"米亞沒有在漫長的暑假裡無所事事,而是在一家書店找了份兼職工作。","part":"A","sec":"Procrastination & Habits 拖延與習慣","lab":"A137","t":"無所事事"},{"w":"dawdle","pos":"v.","def":"to move or act very slowly","cn":"磨蹭;拖拖拉拉","s":"If you ________ on the way to school, you will miss the bus, and then you will be late for the test.","zh":"如果你上學途中拖拖拉拉,你會錯過公車,然後考試就會遲到。","part":"A","sec":"Procrastination & Habits 拖延與習慣","lab":"A138","t":"拖拖拉拉"},{"w":"perfectionism","pos":"n.","def":"the need to make everything perfect","cn":"完美主義","s":"Her ________ made her rewrite the first page ten times, so she never finished the rest of the story.","zh":"她的完美主義讓她把第一頁重寫了十次,所以她一直沒寫完故事的其他部分。","part":"A","sec":"Procrastination & Habits 拖延與習慣","lab":"A139","t":"完美主義"},{"w":"perfectionist","pos":"n.","def":"a person who wants everything to be perfect","cn":"完美主義者","s":"As a ________, Leo spends hours on small details, but he sometimes misses deadlines because of this.","zh":"身為完美主義者,里歐花好幾個小時在小細節上,但他有時因此錯過截止期限。","part":"A","sec":"Procrastination & Habits 拖延與習慣","lab":"A140","t":"完美主義者"},{"w":"decision","pos":"n.","def":"a choice you make after thinking","cn":"決定","s":"Choosing a university is a big ________, so you should talk to teachers and visit the campus before you decide.","zh":"選擇大學是個重大的決定,所以你在決定之前應該和老師談談並參觀校園。","part":"A","sec":"Decision-Making & Judgement 決策與判斷","lab":"A141","t":"決定"},{"w":"choice","pos":"n.","def":"the act of picking one thing from several","cn":"選擇","s":"There were too many ________ on the menu, and it took my friend twenty minutes to order a simple drink.","zh":"菜單上有太多選擇,我的朋友花了二十分鐘才點了一杯簡單的飲料。","part":"A","sec":"Decision-Making & Judgement 決策與判斷","lab":"A142","t":"選擇"},{"w":"judgement","pos":"n.","def":"the ability to make good decisions","cn":"判斷(力)","s":"Lack of sleep can affect your ________, so you should never drive when you feel very tired.","zh":"睡眠不足會影響你的判斷力,所以覺得很累時千萬不要開車。","part":"A","sec":"Decision-Making & Judgement 決策與判斷","lab":"A143","t":"判斷力"},{"w":"heuristic","pos":"n.","def":"a simple rule that helps you decide quickly","cn":"捷思法;經驗法則","s":"People often use a simple ________ when shopping, such as choosing the brand they know, but it does not always give the best result.","zh":"人們購物時常用一種簡單的經驗法則,例如選擇熟悉的品牌,但這不一定能得到最好的結果。","part":"A","sec":"Decision-Making & Judgement 決策與判斷","lab":"A144","t":"經驗法則"},{"w":"intuition","pos":"n.","def":"knowing something from feeling, not from thinking it through","cn":"直覺","s":"My ________ told me something was wrong with the online offer, so I did not give my credit card number.","zh":"我的直覺告訴我那個網路優惠有問題,所以我沒有提供信用卡號碼。","part":"A","sec":"Decision-Making & Judgement 決策與判斷","lab":"A145","t":"直覺"},{"w":"intuitive","pos":"adj.","def":"based on feelings rather than facts; easy to understand","cn":"直覺的;直觀的","s":"The new app is very ________, so even my grandmother learned to use it in a few minutes without any help.","zh":"這個新的應用程式非常直觀,所以連我奶奶都在幾分鐘內不靠任何幫忙就學會使用了。","part":"A","sec":"Decision-Making & Judgement 決策與判斷","lab":"A146","t":"直觀"},{"w":"irrational","pos":"adj.","def":"not based on clear thinking","cn":"不理性的","s":"Her fear of the dark is ________, but it still makes her feel nervous when she walks home at night.","zh":"她對黑暗的恐懼是不理性的,但這仍然讓她晚上走路回家時感到緊張。","part":"A","sec":"Decision-Making & Judgement 決策與判斷","lab":"A147","t":"不理性的"},{"w":"reasoning","pos":"n.","def":"the process of thinking about something in a logical way","cn":"推理;論證","s":"The teacher liked Jason's ________ in his essay, because each point was supported by clear examples.","zh":"老師喜歡傑森文章中的論證,因為每個論點都有清楚的例子支持。","part":"A","sec":"Decision-Making & Judgement 決策與判斷","lab":"A148","t":"論證"},{"w":"logical","pos":"adj.","def":"following clear and sensible thinking","cn":"合乎邏輯的","s":"It is ________ to compare prices before buying a new phone, but many people buy on impulse instead.","zh":"買新手機前比較價格是合乎邏輯的,但許多人反而一時衝動就買了。","part":"A","sec":"Decision-Making & Judgement 決策與判斷","lab":"A149","t":"合乎邏輯"},{"w":"hasty","pos":"adj.","def":"done too quickly without enough thought","cn":"草率的;倉促的","s":"Don't make a ________ decision about quitting the team, because you might feel differently after a good night's sleep.","zh":"不要草率決定退出球隊,因為好好睡一晚之後你可能會有不同的感覺。","part":"A","sec":"Decision-Making & Judgement 決策與判斷","lab":"A150","t":"草率"},{"w":"gamble","pos":"n.","def":"a risky action that may succeed or fail","cn":"冒險;賭注","s":"Leaving his stable job to start a café was a ________, but Mr Lin was willing to take the risk.","zh":"辭掉穩定的工作去開咖啡店是一場賭注,但林先生願意冒這個險。","part":"A","sec":"Decision-Making & Judgement 決策與判斷","lab":"A151","t":"賭注"},{"w":"trade-off","pos":"n.","def":"a balance between two things you cannot have together","cn":"權衡;取捨","s":"There is always a ________ between time and money, because a faster train usually costs more than a slow bus.","zh":"時間和金錢之間總是有取捨,因為較快的火車通常比慢速巴士貴。","part":"A","sec":"Decision-Making & Judgement 決策與判斷","lab":"A152","t":"取捨"},{"w":"regret","pos":"v.","def":"to feel sorry about something you did or did not do","cn":"後悔","s":"I ________ not studying harder in junior high, but I am working much harder now that I am in senior high.","zh":"我後悔國中時沒有更努力讀書,但現在上了高中我努力多了。","part":"A","sec":"Decision-Making & Judgement 決策與判斷","lab":"A153","t":"後悔"},{"w":"hindsight","pos":"n.","def":"understanding a situation only after it has happened","cn":"事後的領悟;後見之明","s":"With ________, I should have started revising earlier, but at the time I thought I had plenty of time.","zh":"事後看來,我應該早點開始複習,但當時我以為時間很充裕。","part":"A","sec":"Decision-Making & Judgement 決策與判斷","lab":"A154","t":"事後看來"},{"w":"reckless","pos":"adj.","def":"doing dangerous things without thinking about the results","cn":"魯莽的","s":"Riding a scooter fast in the rain is ________, and many accidents happen because drivers ignore the danger.","zh":"在雨中騎機車騎很快是很魯莽的,許多事故都是因為駕駛人忽視危險而發生。","part":"A","sec":"Decision-Making & Judgement 決策與判斷","lab":"A155","t":"魯莽"},{"w":"overconfidence","pos":"n.","def":"too much belief in your own ability","cn":"過度自信","s":"His ________ cost him the match, because he did not prepare and thought he would win easily.","zh":"他的過度自信讓他輸掉了比賽,因為他沒有準備,還以為可以輕鬆獲勝。","part":"A","sec":"Decision-Making & Judgement 決策與判斷","lab":"A156","t":"過度自信"},{"w":"confirmation bias","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the habit of only noticing facts that agree with what you already believe","cn":"確認偏誤","s":"Because of ______ ______, people often read news that supports their own opinions, and they ignore other views.","zh":"由於確認偏誤,人們常常閱讀支持自己意見的新聞,而忽略其他觀點。","part":"A","sec":"Decision-Making & Judgement 決策與判斷","lab":"A157","t":"確認偏誤"},{"w":"anchoring","pos":"n.","def":"relying too much on the first number or fact you hear","cn":"錨定效應","s":"Shops use ________ when they show a high \"original price\" first, so the sale price looks like a great deal.","zh":"商店先標出高的「原價」來運用錨定效應,讓特價看起來非常划算。","part":"A","sec":"Decision-Making & Judgement 決策與判斷","lab":"A158","t":"錨定效應"},{"w":"framing","pos":"n.","def":"the way information is presented, which can change choices","cn":"框架效應;表述方式","s":"The ________ of the message mattered, because more people bought the yogurt labelled \"90% fat-free\" than \"10% fat\".","zh":"訊息的表述方式很重要,因為標示「90%無脂」的優格比標示「10%脂肪」的賣得更多。","part":"A","sec":"Decision-Making & Judgement 決策與判斷","lab":"A159","t":"表述方式"},{"w":"loss aversion","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the tendency to fear losing more than you enjoy winning","cn":"損失規避","s":"______ ______ explains why many people keep a bad investment, because selling it would mean accepting a loss.","zh":"損失規避解釋了為什麼許多人會留著不好的投資,因為賣掉就代表要接受虧損。","part":"A","sec":"Decision-Making & Judgement 決策與判斷","lab":"A160","t":"損失規避"},{"w":"sunk cost","pos":"n.phr.","def":"money or time already spent that cannot be recovered","cn":"沉沒成本","s":"I kept watching the boring movie because of the ______ ______ of the ticket, but I just wasted two more hours.","zh":"因為電影票的沉沒成本,我繼續看那部無聊的電影,但我只是又浪費了兩個小時。","part":"A","sec":"Decision-Making & Judgement 決策與判斷","lab":"A161","t":"沉沒成本"},{"w":"preference","pos":"n.","def":"liking one thing more than another","cn":"偏好","s":"Many students have a ________ for studying at night, while others focus better early in the morning.","zh":"許多學生偏好在晚上讀書,而其他人則在一大早比較專心。","part":"A","sec":"Decision-Making & Judgement 決策與判斷","lab":"A162","t":"偏好"},{"w":"opportunity cost","pos":"n.phr.","def":"what you give up when you choose something else","cn":"機會成本","s":"The ______ ______ of playing games all weekend is the study time you lose, so think carefully before you start.","zh":"整個週末打電動的機會成本就是你失去的讀書時間,所以開始前要仔細想想。","part":"A","sec":"Decision-Making & Judgement 決策與判斷","lab":"A163","t":"機會成本"},{"w":"peer pressure","pos":"n.phr.","def":"influence from friends to act like them","cn":"同儕壓力","s":"Because of ______ ______, some teenagers try things they don't really want to do, so it is important to learn to say no.","zh":"由於同儕壓力,有些青少年會嘗試他們其實不想做的事,所以學會說不是很重要的。","part":"A","sec":"Decision-Making & Judgement 決策與判斷","lab":"A164","t":"同儕壓力"},{"w":"conformity","pos":"n.","def":"behaving the same way as most people in a group","cn":"從眾;順從","s":"Wearing a uniform shows ________ to school rules, but some students wish they could express their own style.","zh":"穿制服表示遵從校規,但有些學生希望能表現自己的風格。","part":"A","sec":"Decision-Making & Judgement 決策與判斷","lab":"A165","t":"遵從"},{"w":"groupthink","pos":"n.","def":"when a group agrees too quickly and ignores other ideas","cn":"團體迷思","s":"The team fell into ________, because nobody wanted to argue with the leader, so they missed an obvious problem.","zh":"團隊陷入了團體迷思,因為沒有人想和隊長爭論,所以他們漏掉了一個明顯的問題。","part":"A","sec":"Decision-Making & Judgement 決策與判斷","lab":"A166","t":"團體迷思"},{"w":"advice","pos":"n.","def":"an opinion about what someone should do","cn":"建議;忠告","s":"My older cousin gave me useful ________ about choosing a major, and I felt much clearer about my future.","zh":"我的表哥給了我關於選擇科系很有用的建議,我對未來感到清楚多了。","part":"A","sec":"Decision-Making & Judgement 決策與判斷","lab":"A167","t":"建議"},{"w":"indecisive","pos":"adj.","def":"unable to make decisions quickly","cn":"優柔寡斷的","s":"My sister is so ________ that she spent an hour choosing a T-shirt, and in the end she bought nothing.","zh":"我姊姊非常優柔寡斷,她花了一個小時挑一件T恤,最後什麼都沒買。","part":"A","sec":"Decision-Making & Judgement 決策與判斷","lab":"A168","t":"優柔寡斷"},{"w":"dither","pos":"v.","def":"to be unable to decide what to do","cn":"猶豫不決","s":"If you ________ too long about joining the trip, the tickets may sell out, so please decide by Friday.","zh":"如果你對參加旅行猶豫不決太久,票可能會賣完,所以請在星期五前決定。","part":"A","sec":"Decision-Making & Judgement 決策與判斷","lab":"A169","t":"猶豫不決"},{"w":"hesitate","pos":"v.","def":"to pause before doing something because you are unsure","cn":"猶豫","s":"Please don't ________ to ask questions in class, because other students probably have the same questions too.","zh":"上課時請不要猶豫提問,因為其他同學可能也有同樣的問題。","part":"A","sec":"Decision-Making & Judgement 決策與判斷","lab":"A170","t":"猶豫"},{"w":"weigh","pos":"v.","def":"to think carefully about something before deciding","cn":"權衡;考慮","s":"You should ________ the costs and benefits of a part-time job, because it may take time away from your studies.","zh":"你應該權衡打工的成本與好處,因為它可能會佔用你的讀書時間。","part":"A","sec":"Decision-Making & Judgement 決策與判斷","lab":"A171","t":"權衡"},{"w":"foresight","pos":"n.","def":"the ability to plan for what will happen in the future","cn":"先見之明;遠見","s":"Thanks to her mother's ________, they had packed umbrellas, so they stayed dry when the storm suddenly arrived.","zh":"多虧媽媽的先見之明,她們帶了雨傘,所以暴風雨突然來時她們沒有淋濕。","part":"A","sec":"Decision-Making & Judgement 決策與判斷","lab":"A172","t":"先見之明"},{"w":"rash","pos":"adj.","def":"done too quickly without thinking","cn":"輕率的","s":"Selling his bike on the spot was a ________ decision, and he regretted it the next morning when he had to walk to school.","zh":"當場賣掉腳踏車是個輕率的決定,隔天早上他必須走路上學時就後悔了。","part":"A","sec":"Decision-Making & Judgement 決策與判斷","lab":"A173","t":"輕率"},{"w":"reconsider","pos":"v.","def":"to think again about a decision","cn":"重新考慮","s":"The manager asked Nina to ________ her plan to quit, because the company did not want to lose such a good worker.","zh":"經理請妮娜重新考慮她辭職的計畫,因為公司不想失去這麼好的員工。","part":"A","sec":"Decision-Making & Judgement 決策與判斷","lab":"A174","t":"重新考慮"},{"w":"second-guess","pos":"v.","def":"to doubt a decision after you have made it","cn":"事後懷疑;反覆猜疑","s":"Don't ________ every answer on the test, because your first choice is often correct if you studied well.","zh":"不要對考卷上的每個答案反覆懷疑,因為如果你有好好讀書,第一個選擇往往是對的。","part":"A","sec":"Decision-Making & Judgement 決策與判斷","lab":"A175","t":"反覆懷疑"},{"w":"personality","pos":"n.","def":"the type of person you are, shown by how you behave","cn":"個性;人格","s":"Jenny has a warm ________, so new students always feel welcome when they sit next to her.","zh":"珍妮有溫暖的個性,所以新同學坐在她旁邊總是覺得很受歡迎。","part":"A","sec":"Personality & Social Behaviour 人格與社會行為","lab":"A176","t":"個性"},{"w":"trait","pos":"n.","def":"a quality that is part of someone's character","cn":"特質;特徵","s":"Patience is an important ________ for teachers, because students in the same class often learn at very different speeds.","zh":"耐心是老師重要的特質,因為同一班的學生學習速度常常差很多。","part":"A","sec":"Personality & Social Behaviour 人格與社會行為","lab":"A177","t":"特質"},{"w":"introvert","pos":"n.","def":"a quiet person who gets energy from being alone","cn":"內向的人","s":"As an ________, Ryan enjoys reading alone after school, but he still likes spending time with a few close friends.","zh":"身為內向的人,萊恩喜歡放學後獨自閱讀,但他還是喜歡和幾個好朋友相處。","part":"A","sec":"Personality & Social Behaviour 人格與社會行為","lab":"A178","t":"內向的人"},{"w":"extrovert","pos":"n.","def":"a lively person who gets energy from being with others","cn":"外向的人","s":"My best friend is a true ________, and she feels tired if she has to stay home alone all weekend.","zh":"我最好的朋友是個真正的外向的人,如果整個週末都得獨自待在家,她會覺得很累。","part":"A","sec":"Personality & Social Behaviour 人格與社會行為","lab":"A179","t":"外向的人"},{"w":"outgoing","pos":"adj.","def":"friendly and liking to meet people","cn":"外向的;友善的","s":"Linda is ________ and talks to everyone at parties, while her twin brother prefers to listen quietly.","zh":"琳達很外向,在派對上和每個人聊天,而她的雙胞胎哥哥則比較喜歡安靜地聽。","part":"A","sec":"Personality & Social Behaviour 人格與社會行為","lab":"A180","t":"外向"},{"w":"shy","pos":"adj.","def":"nervous about talking to people you don't know","cn":"害羞的","s":"Tom was too ________ to ask the teacher for help, so he stayed confused about the maths problem for days.","zh":"湯姆太害羞了,不敢向老師求助,所以好幾天都對那道數學題感到困惑。","part":"A","sec":"Personality & Social Behaviour 人格與社會行為","lab":"A181","t":"害羞"},{"w":"sociable","pos":"adj.","def":"enjoying spending time with other people","cn":"好交際的","s":"Dogs are very ________ animals, and they often feel lonely if their owners leave them alone all day.","zh":"狗是非常喜歡與人相處的動物,如果主人整天把牠們單獨留下,牠們常會感到寂寞。","part":"A","sec":"Personality & Social Behaviour 人格與社會行為","lab":"A182","t":"喜歡與人相處"},{"w":"empathy","pos":"n.","def":"the ability to understand how others feel","cn":"同理心","s":"Good doctors show ________ to their patients, because sick people need kindness as well as medicine.","zh":"好醫生會對病人展現同理心,因為生病的人除了藥物也需要關懷。","part":"A","sec":"Personality & Social Behaviour 人格與社會行為","lab":"A183","t":"同理心"},{"w":"sympathy","pos":"n.","def":"feeling sorry for someone who is in trouble","cn":"同情","s":"We sent a card to show our ________ when our teacher's father passed away, and she thanked the whole class.","zh":"老師的父親過世時,我們寄了一張卡片表達同情與慰問,她向全班道謝。","part":"A","sec":"Personality & Social Behaviour 人格與社會行為","lab":"A184","t":"同情與慰問"},{"w":"compassion","pos":"n.","def":"a strong wish to help people who are suffering","cn":"憐憫;同情心","s":"The volunteers treated the homeless with ________, and they listened to their stories as well as giving them food.","zh":"志工們以慈悲心對待無家可歸的人,除了提供食物也聆聽他們的故事。","part":"A","sec":"Personality & Social Behaviour 人格與社會行為","lab":"A185","t":"慈悲心"},{"w":"altruism","pos":"n.","def":"caring about others more than yourself","cn":"利他主義;無私","s":"Donating blood is a simple act of ________, because you help a stranger and expect nothing in return.","zh":"捐血是一種簡單的無私行為,因為你幫助陌生人而不期待任何回報。","part":"A","sec":"Personality & Social Behaviour 人格與社會行為","lab":"A186","t":"無私"},{"w":"selfish","pos":"adj.","def":"caring only about yourself","cn":"自私的","s":"It was ________ of him to eat all the snacks, and his roommates were angry because they had paid for them too.","zh":"他把所有零食都吃光很自私,他的室友們很生氣,因為他們也有出錢。","part":"A","sec":"Personality & Social Behaviour 人格與社會行為","lab":"A187","t":"自私"},{"w":"generous","pos":"adj.","def":"happy to give time, money or help to others","cn":"慷慨的","s":"Our neighbour is very ________, and she often shares the vegetables from her garden with the whole street.","zh":"我們的鄰居非常慷慨,她常把自家菜園的蔬菜分享給整條街的人。","part":"A","sec":"Personality & Social Behaviour 人格與社會行為","lab":"A188","t":"慷慨"},{"w":"stubborn","pos":"adj.","def":"not willing to change your mind","cn":"固執的","s":"My grandfather is ________ about using his old phone, although we have bought him a new one twice.","zh":"我爺爺很固執地要用他的舊手機,雖然我們已經買了兩次新手機給他。","part":"A","sec":"Personality & Social Behaviour 人格與社會行為","lab":"A189","t":"固執"},{"w":"impatient","pos":"adj.","def":"unable to wait calmly","cn":"不耐煩的;沒耐心的","s":"People become ________ when the internet is slow, and some of them close the website after only a few seconds.","zh":"網路很慢時人們會變得不耐煩,有些人只等幾秒鐘就關掉網站。","part":"A","sec":"Personality & Social Behaviour 人格與社會行為","lab":"A190","t":"不耐煩"},{"w":"ego","pos":"n.","def":"your sense of your own importance","cn":"自我;自尊心","s":"Losing the final hurt his ________, but he learned to accept defeat and train harder for next year.","zh":"輸掉決賽傷了他的自尊心,但他學會接受失敗並為明年更努力訓練。","part":"A","sec":"Personality & Social Behaviour 人格與社會行為","lab":"A191","t":"自尊心"},{"w":"self-worth","pos":"n.","def":"the feeling that you are a valuable person","cn":"自我價值","s":"Your ________ should not depend on your test scores, because you have many other strengths as a person.","zh":"你的自我價值不應該取決於考試分數,因為身為一個人你還有許多其他優點。","part":"A","sec":"Personality & Social Behaviour 人格與社會行為","lab":"A192","t":"自我價值"},{"w":"insecure","pos":"adj.","def":"not confident about yourself","cn":"沒有安全感的;不自信的","s":"Social media can make teenagers feel ________ about their looks, so it is wise to limit screen time.","zh":"社群媒體會讓青少年對自己的外表感到不自信,所以限制使用螢幕的時間是明智的。","part":"A","sec":"Personality & Social Behaviour 人格與社會行為","lab":"A193","t":"不自信"},{"w":"bystander","pos":"n.","def":"a person who sees something happen but is not involved","cn":"旁觀者","s":"One ________ called an ambulance after the accident, while others just stood and took photos with their phones.","zh":"事故發生後有一位旁觀者叫了救護車,而其他人只是站著用手機拍照。","part":"A","sec":"Personality & Social Behaviour 人格與社會行為","lab":"A194","t":"旁觀者"},{"w":"obedience","pos":"n.","def":"doing what you are told to do","cn":"服從","s":"The dog trainer taught basic ________ to the puppies, and soon they could sit and wait on command.","zh":"訓犬師教小狗們基本的服從訓練,很快牠們就能聽口令坐下和等待。","part":"A","sec":"Personality & Social Behaviour 人格與社會行為","lab":"A195","t":"服從"},{"w":"persuade","pos":"v.","def":"to make someone agree to do something by giving reasons","cn":"說服","s":"I tried to ________ my parents to let me join the school trip, and I promised to finish my homework first.","zh":"我試著說服爸媽讓我參加校外旅行,並答應會先完成作業。","part":"A","sec":"Personality & Social Behaviour 人格與社會行為","lab":"A196","t":"說服"},{"w":"assertive","pos":"adj.","def":"expressing your opinions clearly and confidently","cn":"有主見的;果斷自信的","s":"Being ________ in group work is useful, but you should also listen carefully to your classmates' ideas.","zh":"在小組作業中有主見很有用,但你也應該仔細聆聽同學的想法。","part":"A","sec":"Personality & Social Behaviour 人格與社會行為","lab":"A197","t":"有主見"},{"w":"aggressive","pos":"adj.","def":"behaving in an angry or violent way","cn":"有攻擊性的;具侵略性的","s":"Some players become ________ when they are losing, so the referee has to stop the game and calm them down.","zh":"有些球員輸球時會變得具攻擊性,所以裁判必須暫停比賽讓他們冷靜下來。","part":"A","sec":"Personality & Social Behaviour 人格與社會行為","lab":"A198","t":"具攻擊性"},{"w":"reserved","pos":"adj.","def":"not showing your feelings or opinions easily","cn":"拘謹的;含蓄的","s":"My new classmate seemed ________ at first, but after a few weeks she became one of the funniest people in our class.","zh":"我的新同學一開始看起來很拘謹,但幾週後她成了我們班最有趣的人之一。","part":"A","sec":"Personality & Social Behaviour 人格與社會行為","lab":"A199","t":"拘謹"},{"w":"easy-going","pos":"adj.","def":"relaxed and not easily worried or annoyed","cn":"隨和的","s":"Our homeroom teacher is very ________, so students feel comfortable telling her about their problems.","zh":"我們的導師非常隨和,所以學生們很自在地跟她說自己的問題。","part":"A","sec":"Personality & Social Behaviour 人格與社會行為","lab":"A200","t":"隨和"},{"w":"analogy","pos":"n.","def":"a comparison that explains one thing by showing how it is like another","cn":"類比","s":"The teacher used an ________ to explain stress, saying the mind is like a cup that overflows if you keep pouring water into it.","zh":"老師用一個類比來解釋壓力,說心靈就像一個杯子,一直倒水就會滿出來。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B1","t":"類比"},{"w":"negate","pos":"v.","def":"to cancel the effect of something","cn":"抵消;使無效","s":"Staying up all night can ________ the benefits of studying, because a tired brain cannot remember new information well.","zh":"整夜不睡會抵消讀書的效果,因為疲累的大腦無法好好記住新資訊。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B2","t":"抵消"},{"w":"notwithstanding","pos":"adv.","def":"despite this","cn":"儘管如此","s":"The exam was very difficult; Sarah passed it easily ________, because she had practised with past papers for months.","zh":"那次考試非常難;儘管如此,莎拉還是輕鬆通過了,因為她用考古題練習了好幾個月。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B3","t":"儘管如此"},{"w":"pose","pos":"v.","def":"to create a problem or question","cn":"造成;提出","s":"Too much screen time can ________ a risk to teenagers' sleep, so many parents set phone rules at night.","zh":"過多的螢幕時間會對青少年的睡眠造成風險,所以許多父母在晚上訂下手機規則。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B4","t":"造成"},{"w":"ambivalent","pos":"adj.","def":"having mixed feelings about something","cn":"矛盾的;心情複雜的","s":"Kevin felt ________ about moving abroad, because he was excited about the new school but sad to leave his friends.","zh":"凱文對出國感到心情矛盾,因為他對新學校很興奮,卻也捨不得離開朋友。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B5","t":"心情矛盾"},{"w":"apprehensive","pos":"adj.","def":"worried that something bad may happen","cn":"憂慮的;擔心的","s":"Many students feel ________ about the first day of university, but most of them settle in within a few weeks.","zh":"許多學生對大學第一天感到憂慮,但大多數人在幾週內就適應了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B6","t":"憂慮"},{"w":"astute","pos":"adj.","def":"clever at understanding situations quickly","cn":"精明的;敏銳的","s":"An ________ teacher can notice when a student is stressed, even if the student smiles and says everything is fine.","zh":"一位敏銳的老師能察覺學生何時有壓力,即使學生微笑著說一切都很好。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B7","t":"敏銳"},{"w":"attentive","pos":"adj.","def":"listening or watching carefully","cn":"專心的;留意的","s":"The students were very ________ during the talk on sleep, because the speaker gave many useful and funny examples.","zh":"學生們在關於睡眠的講座中非常專心,因為講者舉了許多實用又有趣的例子。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B8","t":"專心"},{"w":"aversion","pos":"n.","def":"a strong dislike of something","cn":"厭惡;反感","s":"Some people have an ________ to risk, so they choose a safe job even when a riskier one pays more.","zh":"有些人對風險有反感,所以即使有風險的工作薪水更高,他們仍選擇安穩的工作。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B9","t":"反感"},{"w":"benign","pos":"adj.","def":"not harmful","cn":"無害的;良性的","s":"A little stress before a test is usually ________, and it can even help you stay alert and focused.","zh":"考試前有一點壓力通常是無害的,甚至能幫助你保持警覺和專注。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B10","t":"無害"},{"w":"coincidence","pos":"n.","def":"when two things happen together by chance","cn":"巧合","s":"It was a ________ that we both chose the same university, but we were very happy to have a familiar friend there.","zh":"我們都選了同一所大學是個巧合,但能在那裡有個熟悉的朋友讓我們很開心。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B11","t":"巧合"},{"w":"commonplace","pos":"adj.","def":"happening often; not unusual","cn":"司空見慣的;普遍的","s":"Online counselling has become ________ in recent years, and many students find it easier than talking face to face.","zh":"近年來線上諮商已變得普遍,許多學生覺得這比面對面談話容易。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B12","t":"普遍"},{"w":"compelling","pos":"adj.","def":"very interesting or convincing","cn":"令人信服的;引人入勝的","s":"The scientist gave ________ evidence that exercise reduces stress, so many listeners decided to start walking every day.","zh":"那位科學家提出了運動能減輕壓力的有力證據,所以許多聽眾決定開始每天散步。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B13","t":"有力"},{"w":"comprehension","pos":"n.","def":"the ability to understand something","cn":"理解(力)","s":"Stress can reduce your reading ________, so you may need to read a passage twice when you are very anxious.","zh":"壓力會降低你的閱讀理解力,所以在很焦慮時你可能需要把文章讀兩遍。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B14","t":"理解力"},{"w":"conceivable","pos":"adj.","def":"possible to imagine or believe","cn":"可想像的;可能的","s":"It is ________ that the test will be harder this year, so we should prepare more carefully than last year's students did.","zh":"今年的考試可能會更難,所以我們應該比去年的學生準備得更仔細。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B15","t":"可能"},{"w":"concur","pos":"v.","def":"to agree","cn":"同意","s":"Most experts ________ that regular sleep is important for learning, but many teenagers still go to bed after midnight.","zh":"大多數專家都同意規律的睡眠對學習很重要,但許多青少年仍然在午夜後才上床。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B16","t":"同意"},{"w":"condone","pos":"v.","def":"to accept bad behaviour as acceptable","cn":"縱容;寬恕","s":"The school does not ________ bullying, and any student who hurts others will have to meet the principal.","zh":"學校不縱容霸凌,任何傷害他人的學生都必須去見校長。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B17","t":"縱容"},{"w":"conscious","pos":"adj.","def":"aware of something","cn":"意識到的;察覺的","s":"Ella was ________ of her shaking voice during the speech, but she kept going and finished with a big smile.","zh":"艾拉在演講中意識到自己的聲音在發抖,但她繼續講下去,並帶著燦爛的笑容結束。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B18","t":"意識到"},{"w":"constructive","pos":"adj.","def":"helpful and useful, meant to improve something","cn":"建設性的","s":"The coach gave the players ________ comments after the game, so they knew exactly what to practise next week.","zh":"教練在比賽後給球員們有建設性的意見,所以他們確切知道下週要練習什麼。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B19","t":"有建設性"},{"w":"conviction","pos":"n.","def":"a strong belief","cn":"堅定的信念;確信","s":"She spoke with ________ about the value of hard work, and her words motivated many students in the hall.","zh":"她以堅定的信念談論努力的價值,她的話激勵了禮堂裡許多學生。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B20","t":"堅定的信念"},{"w":"counterproductive","pos":"adj.","def":"having the opposite effect of what you want","cn":"適得其反的","s":"Studying for ten hours without a break is ________, because your brain gets tired and you remember less.","zh":"連續讀十個小時不休息是適得其反的,因為大腦會疲勞,你記得的反而更少。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B21","t":"適得其反"},{"w":"cultivate","pos":"v.","def":"to develop a skill, quality or habit","cn":"培養","s":"Parents can help children ________ good study habits, and these habits will be useful for the rest of their lives.","zh":"父母可以幫助孩子培養良好的讀書習慣,而這些習慣會讓他們受用一生。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B22","t":"培養"},{"w":"dichotomy","pos":"n.","def":"a division between two opposite things","cn":"二分法;對立","s":"There is a false ________ between work and rest, because good rest actually makes your work better.","zh":"工作與休息之間是一種錯誤的二分對立,因為好好休息其實能讓你的工作更好。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B23","t":"二分對立"},{"w":"disposition","pos":"n.","def":"a person's natural character","cn":"性情;氣質","s":"My grandmother has a cheerful ________, and she rarely worries even when life becomes difficult.","zh":"我奶奶有開朗的性情,即使生活變得艱難她也很少憂慮。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B24","t":"性情"},{"w":"disregard","pos":"v.","def":"to ignore something","cn":"忽視;不理會","s":"Many busy workers ________ the warning signs of stress, and they only see a doctor when they become ill.","zh":"許多忙碌的上班族忽視壓力的警訊,直到生病才去看醫生。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B25","t":"忽視"},{"w":"dubious","pos":"adj.","def":"not sure; probably not true or honest","cn":"可疑的;半信半疑的","s":"I was ________ about the advert that promised to cure stress in one day, so I did not buy the expensive pills.","zh":"我對那個保證一天就能消除壓力的廣告感到半信半疑,所以我沒有買那昂貴的藥丸。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B26","t":"半信半疑"},{"w":"erroneous","pos":"adj.","def":"wrong; not correct","cn":"錯誤的","s":"It is an ________ belief that stress is always bad, because a small amount can help people perform better.","zh":"認為壓力總是不好的是一種錯誤的觀念,因為少量的壓力能幫助人表現得更好。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B27","t":"錯誤"},{"w":"evoke","pos":"v.","def":"to bring a feeling or memory into your mind","cn":"喚起;引起","s":"The smell of my grandmother's soup ________ happy memories, and it always makes me feel calm and safe.","zh":"奶奶煮的湯的味道喚起美好的回憶,它總是讓我感到平靜和安心。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B28","t":"喚起"},{"w":"exaggerate","pos":"v.","def":"to describe something as bigger or worse than it is","cn":"誇大","s":"People under stress often ________ their problems, so talking to a friend can help them see things more clearly.","zh":"處於壓力下的人常常誇大自己的問題,所以和朋友聊聊可以幫助他們看得更清楚。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B29","t":"誇大"},{"w":"excel","pos":"v.","def":"to be very good at something","cn":"擅長;表現優異","s":"Some students ________ in exams, while others perform better in projects, so teachers should use different kinds of tests.","zh":"有些學生在考試中表現優異,而有些人在專題中表現更好,所以老師應該使用不同類型的評量。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B30","t":"表現優異"},{"w":"fulfil","pos":"v.","def":"to do what you hoped or promised","cn":"實現;履行","s":"He worked hard for three years, and he finally ________ his dream of studying music in Vienna.","zh":"他努力了三年,終於實現了到維也納學音樂的夢想。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B31","t":"實現"},{"w":"indifferent","pos":"adj.","def":"not interested or caring","cn":"漠不關心的","s":"Some students seem ________ to their grades, but they may simply be hiding their worries from others.","zh":"有些學生對成績似乎漠不關心,但他們可能只是向別人隱藏自己的擔憂。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B32","t":"漠不關心"},{"w":"ingrained","pos":"adj.","def":"so fixed that it is hard to change","cn":"根深蒂固的","s":"Her habit of checking messages at night was so ________ that it took months to break, but she now sleeps much better.","zh":"她晚上查看訊息的習慣是如此根深蒂固,花了好幾個月才戒掉,但現在她睡得好多了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B33","t":"根深蒂固"},{"w":"instil","pos":"v.","def":"to slowly make someone have a feeling or idea","cn":"灌輸;逐漸培養","s":"Good coaches ________ confidence in young players, and this belief helps them stay calm in difficult games.","zh":"好教練會在年輕球員心中逐漸培養自信,而這份信念幫助他們在艱難的比賽中保持冷靜。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B34","t":"逐漸培養"},{"w":"intervene","pos":"v.","def":"to get involved to stop or change a situation","cn":"介入;干預","s":"When two students started arguing loudly, the teacher had to ________, and she helped them talk about the problem calmly.","zh":"兩個學生開始大聲爭吵時,老師必須介入,她幫助他們冷靜地討論問題。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B35","t":"介入"},{"w":"intimidate","pos":"v.","def":"to make someone feel frightened or less confident","cn":"使害怕;威嚇","s":"Large crowds ________ some speakers, so they practise in front of small groups first and slowly build their confidence.","zh":"大批群眾會讓一些講者感到畏懼,所以他們先在小團體面前練習,慢慢建立自信。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B36","t":"感到畏懼"},{"w":"lapse","pos":"n.","def":"a short time when you fail to do something well","cn":"失誤;疏忽","s":"A brief ________ in concentration caused the driver to miss the red light, but luckily nobody was hurt.","zh":"一時注意力疏失讓駕駛人沒注意到紅燈,但幸好沒有人受傷。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B37","t":"疏失"},{"w":"obsession","pos":"n.","def":"thinking about something all the time","cn":"著迷;執念","s":"His ________ with perfect grades made him unhappy, so his parents told him that effort mattered more than scores.","zh":"他對完美成績的執念讓他不快樂,所以他的父母告訴他努力比分數更重要。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B38","t":"執念"},{"w":"overestimate","pos":"v.","def":"to think something is bigger or better than it is","cn":"高估","s":"Students often ________ how much they can study in one night, and then they feel disappointed when they cannot finish.","zh":"學生常常高估自己一個晚上能讀多少,結果讀不完時就感到失望。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B39","t":"高估"},{"w":"ponder","pos":"v.","def":"to think carefully about something for a long time","cn":"沉思;仔細考慮","s":"She ________ the job offer for a whole week, because it meant moving to a city where she knew nobody.","zh":"她仔細考慮那份工作邀約整整一週,因為那代表她要搬到一個一個人都不認識的城市。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B40","t":"仔細考慮"},{"w":"precipitate","pos":"v.","def":"to make something bad happen suddenly or sooner","cn":"促成;使突然發生","s":"Losing his job ________ a difficult period in his life, but the support of his family helped him recover.","zh":"失業促成了他人生中一段艱難的時期,但家人的支持幫助他重新振作。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B41","t":"促成"},{"w":"preoccupied","pos":"adj.","def":"thinking so much about something that you ignore other things","cn":"心事重重的;全神貫注於","s":"Dad was ________ with work problems during dinner, so he did not hear my news about the school prize.","zh":"爸爸晚餐時滿腦子都是工作上的問題,所以沒聽到我得到學校獎項的消息。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B42","t":"滿腦子"},{"w":"presumption","pos":"n.","def":"something you believe is true without proof","cn":"推定;假設","s":"The ________ that boys are better at maths is wrong, and it can discourage many talented girls.","zh":"認為男生數學比較好的假設是錯的,而且會使許多有天分的女生灰心。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B43","t":"假設"},{"w":"propensity","pos":"n.","def":"a natural tendency to behave in a certain way","cn":"傾向;習性","s":"Some people have a ________ to worry, so they need to practise calming techniques more than others do.","zh":"有些人天生有愛擔心的傾向,所以他們比別人更需要練習放鬆的技巧。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B44","t":"傾向"},{"w":"proponent","pos":"n.","def":"a person who supports an idea","cn":"支持者;擁護者","s":"Dr Chen is a strong ________ of short daily exercise, and she says it can improve both mood and memory.","zh":"陳醫師是每天短時間運動的堅定支持者,她說這可以改善情緒和記憶力。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B45","t":"支持者"},{"w":"reassess","pos":"v.","def":"to think about something again and maybe change your opinion","cn":"重新評估","s":"After failing the first test, Leo ________ his study methods, and he started using flashcards and practice questions.","zh":"第一次考試不及格之後,里歐重新評估他的讀書方法,並開始使用單字卡和練習題。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B46","t":"重新評估"},{"w":"retrospect","pos":"n.","def":"thinking about a past event","cn":"回顧;回想","s":"In ________, the stressful exam year taught me how to manage my time, so I am grateful for it now.","zh":"回想起來,那壓力很大的考試年教會我如何管理時間,所以現在我很感謝那段日子。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B47","t":"回想起來"},{"w":"spontaneous","pos":"adj.","def":"done suddenly without planning","cn":"自發的;即興的","s":"We made a ________ decision to go hiking on Saturday, and the fresh air helped us forget about our exams.","zh":"我們臨時起意決定星期六去爬山,新鮮的空氣幫助我們忘掉考試。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B48","t":"臨時起意"},{"w":"stagnant","pos":"adj.","def":"not moving, changing or developing","cn":"停滯的","s":"His English felt ________ after months of using the same textbook, so he started watching English videos every day.","zh":"用同一本課本好幾個月後,他覺得自己的英文停滯不前,所以他開始每天看英文影片。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B49","t":"停滯不前"},{"w":"subconscious","pos":"adj.","def":"happening in your mind without you knowing","cn":"潛意識的","s":"Our ________ worries can appear in our dreams, so stressful weeks often bring strange dreams at night.","zh":"我們潛意識裡的擔憂會出現在夢中,所以壓力大的那幾週晚上常會做奇怪的夢。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B50","t":"潛意識"},{"w":"tendency","pos":"n.","def":"a habit of behaving in a certain way","cn":"傾向","s":"Tom has a ________ to leave everything until the last minute, so his teacher helped him make a weekly plan.","zh":"湯姆有把每件事都拖到最後一刻的傾向,所以老師幫他擬定每週計畫。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B51","t":"傾向"},{"w":"trivial","pos":"adj.","def":"small and not important","cn":"瑣碎的;微不足道的","s":"When you are tired, ________ problems can feel huge, but a good night's sleep often makes them seem small again.","zh":"當你很累時,微不足道的問題也會感覺很嚴重,但好好睡一晚常常會讓它們又顯得很小。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B52","t":"微不足道"},{"w":"undue","pos":"adj.","def":"more than is reasonable or necessary","cn":"過度的;不適當的","s":"Parents should not put ________ pressure on their children, because too much stress can make learning harder.","zh":"父母不應該給孩子過度的壓力,因為太多壓力會讓學習變得更困難。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B53","t":"過度的"},{"w":"utmost","pos":"adj.","def":"the greatest possible","cn":"最大的;極度的","s":"Mental health is of the ________ importance, and schools should give students time to rest as well as study.","zh":"心理健康是極為重要的,學校應該讓學生有讀書也有休息的時間。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B54","t":"極為"},{"w":"withstand / withstood / withstood","pos":"v.","def":"to deal with something difficult without being harmed","cn":"承受;抵擋","s":"Regular exercise helps the body ________ stress, so even a short walk each day can make a difference.","zh":"規律運動幫助身體承受壓力,所以即使每天短暫散步也能帶來改變。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B55","t":"承受"},{"w":"adversity","pos":"n.","def":"a very difficult situation","cn":"逆境","s":"She showed great courage in the face of ________, and she continued her studies even after her family lost their home.","zh":"她在逆境中展現極大的勇氣,即使家裡失去了房子她仍繼續學業。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B56","t":"逆境"},{"w":"alienate","pos":"v.","def":"to make someone feel unfriendly or not part of a group","cn":"使疏遠","s":"Constant criticism can ________ teenagers from their parents, so families should also talk about good news.","zh":"不斷的批評會讓青少年和父母疏遠,所以家人之間也應該聊聊好消息。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B57","t":"疏遠"},{"w":"burdensome","pos":"adj.","def":"difficult to deal with; heavy","cn":"繁重的;累贅的","s":"The extra homework felt ________ during exam season, so the students asked their teacher for a little more time.","zh":"考試季節額外的作業讓人覺得很繁重,所以學生們請老師多給一點時間。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B58","t":"繁重"},{"w":"candid","pos":"adj.","def":"honest and direct","cn":"坦白的;直率的","s":"The singer was ________ about her stage fright in the interview, and many fans said her story helped them.","zh":"那位歌手在訪談中坦白談到自己的怯場,許多歌迷說她的故事幫助了他們。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B59","t":"坦白"},{"w":"caution","pos":"n.","def":"care to avoid danger or mistakes","cn":"謹慎;小心","s":"You should use ________ when taking advice from social media, because not everyone online is an expert.","zh":"從社群媒體獲取建議時你應該謹慎,因為網路上並不是每個人都是專家。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B60","t":"謹慎"},{"w":"cohesion","pos":"n.","def":"the state of a group being united","cn":"凝聚力","s":"Team-building games improved the class's ________, and students started helping each other with difficult homework.","zh":"團隊建立遊戲提升了全班的凝聚力,學生們開始互相幫忙解決困難的作業。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B61","t":"凝聚力"},{"w":"commend","pos":"v.","def":"to praise someone formally","cn":"表揚;稱讚","s":"The principal ________ the students for their hard work, and she gave each of them a certificate at the ceremony.","zh":"校長表揚了學生們的努力,並在典禮上頒給每個人一張證書。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B62","t":"表揚"},{"w":"compulsion","pos":"n.","def":"a strong feeling that you must do something","cn":"強迫;衝動","s":"Many people feel a ________ to check their phones every few minutes, even when they are not expecting any messages.","zh":"許多人覺得有一股衝動每隔幾分鐘就要查看手機,即使他們並沒有在等任何訊息。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B63","t":"衝動"},{"w":"contention","pos":"n.","def":"an opinion that someone argues for","cn":"論點;主張","s":"The writer's main ________ is that rest improves performance, and she supports it with several interesting studies.","zh":"作者的主要論點是休息能提升表現,她用幾項有趣的研究來支持它。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B64","t":"論點"},{"w":"dependable","pos":"adj.","def":"able to be trusted","cn":"可靠的","s":"A ________ friend is someone who listens when you are stressed, and they don't share your secrets with others.","zh":"可靠的朋友是在你有壓力時會傾聽的人,而且他們不會把你的祕密告訴別人。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B65","t":"可靠"},{"w":"deprive","pos":"v.","def":"to take something important away from someone","cn":"剝奪","s":"Late-night gaming ________ many teenagers of sleep, and they then find it hard to concentrate at school.","zh":"深夜打電動剝奪了許多青少年的睡眠,導致他們在學校難以專心。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B66","t":"剝奪"},{"w":"detract","pos":"v.","def":"to make something seem less good","cn":"減損;貶低","s":"One small mistake did not ________ from her excellent performance, and the judges still gave her first prize.","zh":"一個小失誤並沒有減損她出色的表現,評審仍然給了她第一名。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B67","t":"減損"},{"w":"discretion","pos":"n.","def":"the right to decide something; care in what you say","cn":"斟酌決定權;謹慎","s":"Teachers have the ________ to give students extra time, and they often do so when a student is ill.","zh":"老師有斟酌決定是否給學生額外時間的權力,當學生生病時他們常會這麼做。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B68","t":"斟酌決定"},{"w":"disillusioned","pos":"adj.","def":"disappointed because something is not as good as you believed","cn":"幻滅的;失望的","s":"Many young workers become ________ with long hours, so they look for jobs with a better work-life balance.","zh":"許多年輕上班族對長工時感到幻滅,所以他們尋找工作與生活更平衡的工作。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B69","t":"幻滅"},{"w":"dismiss","pos":"v.","def":"to decide something is not important","cn":"不予理會;摒棄","s":"Don't ________ your feelings as silly, because talking about them is the first step to feeling better.","zh":"不要把你的感受當作很傻而不予理會,因為說出來是讓自己好過一點的第一步。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B70","t":"不予理會"},{"w":"distraught","pos":"adj.","def":"extremely upset and worried","cn":"心煩意亂的;極度不安的","s":"The boy was ________ when he lost his dog in the park, but a kind stranger helped him find it an hour later.","zh":"那個男孩在公園弄丟了狗時心煩意亂,但一位好心的陌生人一小時後幫他找到了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B71","t":"心煩意亂"},{"w":"eloquent","pos":"adj.","def":"able to speak or write clearly and powerfully","cn":"口才好的;有說服力的","s":"The student gave an ________ speech about mental health, and many classmates cried because it was so honest.","zh":"那位學生發表了一場關於心理健康、很有感染力的演講,許多同學哭了,因為它是如此真誠。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B72","t":"很有感染力"},{"w":"embrace","pos":"v.","def":"to accept something new with enthusiasm","cn":"欣然接受","s":"Successful students ________ challenges instead of avoiding them, because they see mistakes as a normal part of learning.","zh":"成功的學生會欣然接受挑戰而不是逃避,因為他們把錯誤視為學習中正常的一部分。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B73","t":"欣然接受"},{"w":"endure","pos":"v.","def":"to suffer something difficult for a long time","cn":"忍受;忍耐","s":"Athletes must ________ hours of hard training, but the joy of winning makes the pain worthwhile for many of them.","zh":"運動員必須忍受好幾個小時的艱苦訓練,但對許多人來說,勝利的喜悅讓這些痛苦都值得。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B74","t":"忍受"},{"w":"enlighten","pos":"v.","def":"to give someone more knowledge or understanding","cn":"啟發;使明白","s":"The talk on sleep science really ________ us, and many students decided to put their phones away at night.","zh":"那場關於睡眠科學的演講真的啟發了我們,許多學生決定晚上把手機收起來。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B75","t":"啟發"},{"w":"entitle","pos":"v.","def":"to give someone the right to do or have something","cn":"使有權利","s":"Every worker is ________ to rest breaks during the day, but some busy employees skip them to finish their tasks.","zh":"每位員工都有權在白天享有休息時間,但有些忙碌的員工為了完成工作而跳過休息。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B76","t":"有權"},{"w":"envision","pos":"v.","def":"to imagine something that may happen in the future","cn":"設想;展望","s":"Before the race, the runner likes to ________ herself crossing the finish line, and this helps her feel calm and ready.","zh":"比賽前,那位跑者喜歡想像自己衝過終點線,這幫助她感到冷靜並做好準備。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B77","t":"想像"},{"w":"evasive","pos":"adj.","def":"avoiding giving a clear answer","cn":"迴避的;含糊其詞的","s":"When I asked my brother about his test, he was ________, so I guessed that he had not done very well.","zh":"我問弟弟考試考得如何時,他含糊其詞,所以我猜他考得不太好。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B78","t":"含糊其詞"},{"w":"exceptional","pos":"adj.","def":"unusually good","cn":"傑出的;特別優秀的","s":"She showed ________ calm during the emergency, and her quick thinking helped everyone leave the building safely.","zh":"她在緊急狀況中展現了非凡的冷靜,她的機智幫助大家安全離開大樓。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B79","t":"非凡的"},{"w":"exemplary","pos":"adj.","def":"so good that others should copy it","cn":"模範的;可作為榜樣的","s":"The student's behaviour was ________ during the school trip, so the teacher asked him to help lead the next one.","zh":"那位學生在校外教學期間的表現堪為模範,所以老師請他幫忙帶領下一次的活動。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B80","t":"堪為模範"},{"w":"exhilarating","pos":"adj.","def":"very exciting and making you feel happy","cn":"令人振奮的","s":"Riding the roller coaster was ________, and for a few minutes I completely forgot about my homework.","zh":"坐雲霄飛車令人非常興奮,有好幾分鐘我完全忘了作業的事。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B81","t":"令人非常興奮"},{"w":"fixate","pos":"v.","def":"to think about one thing too much","cn":"執著於;過分關注","s":"If you ________ on one bad grade, you may lose confidence, so try to look at your overall progress instead.","zh":"如果你執著於一次不好的成績,可能會失去自信,所以試著改看你整體的進步。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B82","t":"執著於"},{"w":"fortify","pos":"v.","def":"to make something stronger","cn":"強化;加強","s":"A good breakfast can ________ your body for a long day of tests, so don't skip it even when you are in a hurry.","zh":"一頓好的早餐能強化你的身體以應付一整天的考試,所以即使匆忙也不要跳過。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B83","t":"強化"},{"w":"inclined","pos":"adj.","def":"likely to do something or behave in a certain way","cn":"傾向於……的","s":"Tired people are more ________ to make poor choices, so it is wise not to make big decisions late at night.","zh":"疲倦的人比較傾向做出不好的選擇,所以深夜不做重大決定是明智的。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B84","t":"傾向"},{"w":"overdue","pos":"adj.","def":"late; should have happened before now","cn":"過期的;早該發生的","s":"My library book was two weeks ________, and I had to pay a small fine because I forgot to return it.","zh":"我的圖書館書已經逾期兩週了,因為我忘記歸還,只好付了一小筆罰款。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B85","t":"逾期"},{"w":"toll","pos":"n.","def":"the bad effect that something has over time","cn":"損害;代價","s":"Months of night shifts took a heavy ________ on the nurse's health, so she finally asked for a day job.","zh":"好幾個月的夜班對那位護理師的健康造成了嚴重的損害,所以她終於申請了白班工作。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B86","t":"損害"},{"w":"outset","pos":"n.","def":"the start of something","cn":"開始;開端","s":"At the ________ of the course, the teacher explained all the rules, so nobody was surprised by the strict deadlines.","zh":"課程一開始,老師就解釋了所有規則,所以沒有人對嚴格的截止期限感到意外。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B87","t":"開始"},{"w":"interplay","pos":"n.","def":"the way two or more things affect each other","cn":"相互作用","s":"There is a complex ________ between sleep and mood, because poor sleep makes us sad and sadness makes sleep harder.","zh":"睡眠和情緒之間有複雜的相互影響,因為睡不好讓我們難過,而難過又讓人更難入睡。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B88","t":"相互影響"},{"w":"intricacy","pos":"n.","def":"a small detail that makes something complicated","cn":"錯綜複雜;細節","s":"The ________ of the human mind fascinates scientists, but there are still many things about it that we do not understand.","zh":"人類心智的錯綜複雜讓科學家著迷,但關於它仍有許多我們不了解的事。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B89","t":"錯綜複雜"},{"w":"irrespective","pos":"adv.","def":"without considering something","cn":"不論;不管","s":"Everyone needs rest ________ of their age, so both children and adults should sleep for enough hours every night.","zh":"不論年齡,每個人都需要休息,所以孩子和大人每晚都應該睡足夠的時間。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B90","t":"不論"},{"w":"justifiable","pos":"adj.","def":"having a good reason","cn":"合理的;情有可原的","s":"Her anger was ________ because her partner did none of the group work, but she still spoke to him politely.","zh":"她的憤怒是情有可原的,因為她的組員完全沒做小組作業,但她仍然禮貌地跟他說話。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B91","t":"情有可原"},{"w":"lethargic","pos":"adj.","def":"tired and without energy","cn":"無精打采的;懶洋洋的","s":"I always feel ________ after eating a huge lunch, so I now eat a smaller meal and take a short walk.","zh":"吃完一頓豐盛的午餐後我總覺得無精打采,所以我現在吃少一點,並短暫散個步。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B92","t":"無精打采"},{"w":"mediocre","pos":"adj.","def":"not very good; only average","cn":"平庸的;普通的","s":"His first essay was ________, but he read his teacher's comments carefully and the next one was much better.","zh":"他的第一篇文章很普通,但他仔細看了老師的評語,下一篇就好多了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B93","t":"普通"},{"w":"merit","pos":"n.","def":"a good quality that deserves praise","cn":"優點;價值","s":"Each plan has its ________, so the team discussed both of them carefully before they made a final decision.","zh":"每個計畫都有它的優點,所以團隊在做最後決定前仔細討論了兩個計畫。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B94","t":"優點"},{"w":"misconception","pos":"n.","def":"a wrong idea or belief","cn":"誤解;錯誤觀念","s":"It is a common ________ that asking for help is a sign of weakness, but it actually shows strength and good sense.","zh":"認為求助是軟弱的表現是常見的誤解,但其實這展現了堅強和明智。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B95","t":"誤解"},{"w":"mislead / misled / misled","pos":"v.","def":"to make someone believe something false","cn":"誤導","s":"The advert ________ customers into thinking the drink could reduce stress, so the company had to change it.","zh":"那則廣告誤導顧客以為那種飲料可以減輕壓力,所以公司必須修改它。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B96","t":"誤導"},{"w":"monotonous","pos":"adj.","def":"boring because it never changes","cn":"單調乏味的","s":"Copying words again and again is ________, so our teacher uses games to help us remember new vocabulary.","zh":"一遍又一遍地抄寫單字很單調乏味,所以老師用遊戲幫助我們記住新單字。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B97","t":"單調乏味"},{"w":"multifaceted","pos":"adj.","def":"having many different parts or sides","cn":"多面向的","s":"Stress is a ________ problem, so the solution may involve sleep, exercise, diet and support from friends.","zh":"壓力是一個多面向的問題,所以解決方法可能包括睡眠、運動、飲食以及朋友的支持。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B98","t":"多面向"},{"w":"obligatory","pos":"adj.","def":"required by a rule","cn":"必須的;義務的","s":"Attendance at the safety talk was ________, so every student had to sign their name at the door.","zh":"參加安全講座是必須的,所以每位學生都得在門口簽名。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B99","t":"必須的"},{"w":"optimum","pos":"adj.","def":"best; most suitable","cn":"最佳的;最適宜的","s":"Scientists say the ________ amount of sleep for teenagers is about nine hours, but most of them get much less.","zh":"科學家說青少年最佳的睡眠時數大約是九小時,但大多數人睡得少得多。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B100","t":"最佳的"},{"w":"outlook","pos":"n.","def":"a person's general attitude to life","cn":"觀點;人生觀","s":"Volunteering changed her ________ on life, and she now feels thankful for the small things she has.","zh":"當志工改變了她的人生觀,她現在對自己擁有的小事物心懷感激。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B101","t":"人生觀"},{"w":"overrate","pos":"v.","def":"to think something is better than it really is","cn":"高估;評價過高","s":"Many people ________ the value of expensive gadgets, but simple habits like walking often improve mood more.","zh":"許多人高估了昂貴電子產品的價值,但像散步這樣簡單的習慣往往更能改善心情。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B102","t":"高估"},{"w":"paradoxical","pos":"adj.","def":"seeming impossible because it combines opposite ideas","cn":"矛盾的;似非而是的","s":"It seems ________, but taking more breaks can help you finish your work faster, because your brain stays fresh.","zh":"這看起來很矛盾,但多休息反而能幫助你更快完成工作,因為你的大腦能保持清醒。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B103","t":"矛盾"},{"w":"peripheral","pos":"adj.","def":"not as important as the main part","cn":"次要的;周邊的","s":"Don't waste time on ________ details in the reading test, because most questions focus on the main ideas.","zh":"閱讀測驗中不要在次要細節上浪費時間,因為大多數題目都聚焦在主旨上。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B104","t":"次要"},{"w":"predisposed","pos":"adj.","def":"likely to behave or suffer in a certain way","cn":"易於……的;有……傾向的","s":"Some people are ________ to anxiety because of their family history, but healthy habits can still help a lot.","zh":"有些人因為家族病史而容易焦慮,但健康的習慣仍然能有很大的幫助。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B105","t":"容易"},{"w":"pronounced","pos":"adj.","def":"very noticeable","cn":"明顯的","s":"There was a ________ improvement in her mood after she started jogging, and her friends noticed it within a week.","zh":"她開始慢跑之後心情有了明顯的改善,她的朋友們一週內就注意到了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B106","t":"明顯"},{"w":"quantifiable","pos":"adj.","def":"able to be measured with numbers","cn":"可量化的","s":"Happiness is not easily ________, but researchers use surveys to compare how people feel in different countries.","zh":"快樂不容易量化,但研究人員使用問卷調查來比較不同國家人們的感受。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B107","t":"量化"},{"w":"receptive","pos":"adj.","def":"willing to listen to new ideas","cn":"樂於接受的","s":"Students are more ________ to advice when they feel respected, so teachers should speak to them kindly.","zh":"學生覺得受到尊重時更樂於接受建議,所以老師應該親切地跟他們說話。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B108","t":"樂於接受"},{"w":"reckon","pos":"v.","def":"to think or believe","cn":"認為;估計","s":"I ________ that a short walk would help you relax, so why don't we go to the park after dinner?","zh":"我認為短暫散個步能幫助你放鬆,所以我們晚餐後何不去公園走走?","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B109","t":"認為"},{"w":"reflect","pos":"v.","def":"to think carefully about something you did","cn":"反思;深思","s":"At the end of each week, I ________ on what went well and what I can do better, and I write my ideas in a notebook.","zh":"每週結束時,我會反思哪些事做得好、哪些可以做得更好,並把想法寫在筆記本裡。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B110","t":"反思"},{"w":"refrain","pos":"v.","def":"to stop yourself from doing something","cn":"克制;避免","s":"Please ________ from using your phone during the exam, or the teacher will take your paper away.","zh":"考試期間請避免使用手機,否則老師會把你的考卷收走。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B111","t":"避免"},{"w":"remedial","pos":"adj.","def":"aimed at improving skills that are weak","cn":"補救的","s":"The school offers ________ classes after school, and students who fell behind can catch up there.","zh":"學校在放學後提供補救課程,落後的學生可以在那裡趕上進度。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B112","t":"補救"},{"w":"restraint","pos":"n.","def":"calm control over your feelings or actions","cn":"克制;自制","s":"The referee showed great ________ when the angry fans shouted at him, and he calmly continued the game.","zh":"生氣的球迷對裁判大吼時,他表現出極大的克制,並冷靜地繼續比賽。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B113","t":"克制"},{"w":"rigidity","pos":"n.","def":"being unwilling to change or adapt","cn":"僵化;死板","s":"The ________ of the old timetable caused stress, so the school made it more flexible for students with long journeys.","zh":"舊課表的僵化造成了壓力,所以學校讓它對通勤時間長的學生更有彈性。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B114","t":"僵化"},{"w":"scrutinise","pos":"v.","def":"to examine something very carefully","cn":"仔細檢查;審視","s":"Before signing the contract, my father ________ every line, because he did not want any unpleasant surprises later.","zh":"簽約前,我爸爸仔細檢查了每一行字,因為他不想之後有任何不愉快的意外。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B115","t":"仔細檢查"},{"w":"sensible","pos":"adj.","def":"reasonable and practical","cn":"明智的;合理的","s":"It is ________ to plan your revision early, because you will feel calmer and more prepared on the day of the exam.","zh":"提早規劃複習是明智的,因為考試當天你會覺得更冷靜、更有準備。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B116","t":"明智"},{"w":"shortcoming","pos":"n.","def":"a weakness or fault","cn":"缺點;短處","s":"Everyone has ________, but accepting them is the first step to improving yourself and feeling less stressed.","zh":"每個人都有缺點,但接受它們是改善自己並減輕壓力的第一步。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B117","t":"缺點"},{"w":"signify","pos":"v.","def":"to be a sign of something","cn":"表示;意味著","s":"A sudden loss of interest in hobbies may ________ that a friend is stressed, so it is kind to ask how they are.","zh":"突然對嗜好失去興趣可能意味著朋友有壓力,所以關心問候他們近況是很貼心的。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B118","t":"意味著"},{"w":"subdue","pos":"v.","def":"to bring a strong feeling under control","cn":"抑制;克制","s":"She took a few deep breaths to ________ her anger, and then she explained calmly why she was upset.","zh":"她做了幾次深呼吸來抑制怒氣,然後冷靜地解釋她為什麼不高興。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B119","t":"抑制"},{"w":"substantiate","pos":"v.","def":"to prove something with evidence","cn":"證實","s":"You must ________ your claims with examples in your essay, or the examiner will give you a lower score.","zh":"你必須在文章中用例子證實你的主張,否則閱卷老師會給你較低的分數。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B120","t":"證實"},{"w":"tedious","pos":"adj.","def":"long and boring","cn":"冗長乏味的","s":"Filling in the forms was ________, but my sister finished them quickly because she wanted to start her new job.","zh":"填寫那些表格很冗長乏味,但我姊姊很快就填完了,因為她想趕快開始新工作。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B121","t":"冗長乏味"},{"w":"tenacity","pos":"n.","def":"the quality of not giving up easily","cn":"堅韌;頑強","s":"The young scientist's ________ paid off, because after many failed experiments she finally found the answer.","zh":"那位年輕科學家的堅持不懈得到了回報,因為在許多次失敗的實驗後她終於找到了答案。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B122","t":"堅持不懈"},{"w":"unequivocal","pos":"adj.","def":"completely clear, with no doubt","cn":"明確的;毫不含糊的","s":"The doctor's advice was ________, so my uncle stopped smoking and started exercising the very next day.","zh":"醫生的建議毫不含糊,所以我叔叔隔天就戒菸並開始運動了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B123","t":"毫不含糊"},{"w":"variance","pos":"n.","def":"the amount by which things differ","cn":"差異;變異","s":"There is a large ________ in how much sleep students get, and those who sleep more usually get better grades.","zh":"學生的睡眠時數有很大的差異,而睡得多的人通常成績比較好。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B124","t":"差異"},{"w":"volition","pos":"n.","def":"the power to choose for yourself","cn":"自願;意志","s":"She joined the extra classes of her own ________, and nobody had to tell her to study harder.","zh":"她是出於自己的意願參加額外課程的,沒有人需要叫她更用功。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B125","t":"意願"},{"w":"weary","pos":"adj.","def":"very tired","cn":"疲倦的;厭倦的","s":"The ________ travellers finally reached the hotel after a long delay, and they went straight to bed without eating.","zh":"那些疲憊的旅客在長時間延誤後終於抵達飯店,他們沒吃東西就直接上床睡覺了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B126","t":"疲憊"},{"w":"abstain","pos":"v.","def":"to choose not to do something you enjoy","cn":"戒除;克制不做","s":"My father decided to ________ from coffee for a month, and he found that he slept much better at night.","zh":"我爸爸決定戒一個月的咖啡,他發現自己晚上睡得好多了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B127","t":"戒"},{"w":"accentuate","pos":"v.","def":"to make something more noticeable","cn":"強調;使突出","s":"Lack of sleep can ________ negative feelings, so small problems seem much bigger when you are tired.","zh":"睡眠不足會加劇負面情緒,所以你疲倦時小問題看起來會嚴重得多。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B128","t":"加劇"},{"w":"adept","pos":"adj.","def":"very skilled at something","cn":"熟練的;擅長的","s":"My mother is ________ at calming people down, so neighbours often come to her when they have family problems.","zh":"我媽媽很擅長安撫別人,所以鄰居們有家庭問題時常來找她。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B129","t":"擅長"},{"w":"affirm","pos":"v.","def":"to state that something is true; to support","cn":"肯定;確認","s":"Kind words from parents ________ a child's value, and this helps the child feel safe enough to try new things.","zh":"父母親切的話語能肯定孩子的價值,這幫助孩子感到足夠安心去嘗試新事物。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B130","t":"肯定"},{"w":"allude","pos":"v.","def":"to mention something in an indirect way","cn":"暗指;間接提到","s":"In his speech, the principal ________ to the stress of the coming exams, but he did not talk about them directly.","zh":"校長在演講中間接提到即將到來的考試壓力,但他沒有直接談論。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B131","t":"間接提到"},{"w":"ascertain","pos":"v.","def":"to find out the truth about something","cn":"查明;確定","s":"The teacher tried to ________ why the student was always late, and she learned that he looked after his little sister.","zh":"老師試著查明那位學生為什麼總是遲到,她得知他要照顧妹妹。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B132","t":"查明"},{"w":"baffle","pos":"v.","def":"to confuse someone completely","cn":"使困惑","s":"The last maths question ________ everyone in the class, so the teacher explained it again step by step.","zh":"最後一道數學題讓全班都困惑不已,所以老師一步一步重新講解。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B133","t":"困惑不已"},{"w":"bewilder","pos":"v.","def":"to make someone very confused","cn":"使迷惑;使不知所措","s":"The busy train station ________ my grandmother, so I held her hand and guided her to the right platform.","zh":"繁忙的火車站讓我奶奶不知所措,所以我牽著她的手帶她到正確的月台。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B134","t":"不知所措"},{"w":"cognisant","pos":"adj.","def":"aware of something","cn":"意識到的;認知到的","s":"Teachers should be ________ of the pressure students face, and they should not give too much homework before exams.","zh":"老師應該意識到學生面臨的壓力,考試前不應該出太多作業。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B135","t":"意識到"},{"w":"conjecture","pos":"n.","def":"an opinion based on incomplete information","cn":"推測;猜想","s":"The reason for his sudden absence is only ________, so we should not spread rumours about him.","zh":"他突然缺席的原因只是推測,所以我們不應該散播關於他的謠言。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B136","t":"推測"},{"w":"steadfast","pos":"adj.","def":"staying firm and loyal","cn":"堅定的;不動搖的","s":"Her parents were ________ in their support, and they never criticised her when she failed her first audition.","zh":"她的父母堅定不移地支持她,她第一次試鏡失敗時他們從未責備她。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B137","t":"堅定不移"},{"w":"converge","pos":"v.","def":"to come together at one point","cn":"匯集;趨於一致","s":"Many different studies ________ on one idea, which is that regular exercise improves both mood and memory.","zh":"許多不同的研究都趨向同一個觀點,那就是規律運動能改善情緒和記憶力。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B138","t":"趨向"},{"w":"defer","pos":"v.","def":"to delay something until later","cn":"延後;推遲","s":"Some students ________ their university studies for a year, so they can work, travel and decide what they really want.","zh":"有些學生把大學學業延後一年,這樣他們可以工作、旅行並決定自己真正想要什麼。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B139","t":"延後"},{"w":"devoid","pos":"adj.","def":"completely without something","cn":"完全沒有的","s":"The waiting room was cold and ________ of colour, so the hospital painted it bright yellow to help patients feel calmer.","zh":"候診室冰冷又毫無色彩,所以醫院把它漆成亮黃色,幫助病人感到更平靜。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B140","t":"毫無"},{"w":"discord","pos":"n.","def":"disagreement between people","cn":"不和;紛爭","s":"There was some ________ in the group about the project topic, but they finally agreed after a friendly vote.","zh":"小組對專題題目有些不和,但他們在一次友善的投票後終於達成共識。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B141","t":"不和"},{"w":"disparate","pos":"adj.","def":"very different from each other","cn":"迥然不同的","s":"The club brings together students from ________ backgrounds, and they quickly become friends through music.","zh":"這個社團聚集了來自迥然不同背景的學生,他們透過音樂很快就成為朋友。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B142","t":"迥然不同"},{"w":"dormant","pos":"adj.","def":"not active now but able to become active later","cn":"潛伏的;休眠的","s":"Her love of painting had been ________ for years, but it came back when she joined an art class after retirement.","zh":"她對繪畫的熱愛已經沉寂多年,但退休後參加美術課時又重新燃起。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B143","t":"沉寂"},{"w":"expedite","pos":"v.","def":"to make a process happen faster","cn":"加快;促進","s":"The new online system will ________ the application process, so students will receive their results in days, not weeks.","zh":"新的線上系統將加快申請流程,所以學生會在幾天內而不是幾週內收到結果。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B144","t":"加快"},{"w":"forgo / forwent / forgone","pos":"v.","def":"to choose not to have something you would like","cn":"放棄;摒棄","s":"Many students ________ weekend outings before the big exam, but short breaks are still important for their health.","zh":"許多學生在大考前放棄週末出遊,但短暫的休息對健康仍然很重要。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B145","t":"放棄"},{"w":"heed","pos":"v.","def":"to pay attention to advice or a warning","cn":"聽從;留意","s":"If you ________ your body's warning signs, such as headaches and poor sleep, you can deal with stress before it gets worse.","zh":"如果你留意身體的警訊,例如頭痛和睡不好,就能在壓力惡化之前處理它。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B146","t":"留意"},{"w":"impetuous","pos":"adj.","def":"acting quickly without thinking carefully","cn":"衝動的;魯莽的","s":"He made an ________ decision to quit his job after one bad day, and he regretted it when he could not pay his rent.","zh":"他在糟糕的一天之後做了辭職的衝動決定,當他付不出房租時就後悔了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B147","t":"衝動"},{"w":"inadvertent","pos":"adj.","def":"done without meaning to","cn":"無心的;不經意的","s":"Her ________ comment hurt her friend's feelings, so she apologised as soon as she realised what she had said.","zh":"她無心的一句話傷了朋友的感情,所以她一意識到自己說了什麼就立刻道歉。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B148","t":"無心"},{"w":"incessant","pos":"adj.","def":"never stopping","cn":"不停的;持續不斷的","s":"The ________ noise from the building site made it hard to study, so I went to the library for some peace.","zh":"工地不停的噪音讓人很難讀書,所以我去圖書館找個清靜。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B149","t":"不停"},{"w":"inept","pos":"adj.","def":"having no skill","cn":"笨拙的;無能的","s":"I felt ________ at cooking when I first lived alone, but after many YouTube videos I can now make simple meals.","zh":"我剛開始獨自生活時覺得自己做菜很笨拙,但看了許多影片之後,現在我能做簡單的餐點了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B150","t":"笨拙"},{"w":"insatiable","pos":"adj.","def":"always wanting more","cn":"無法滿足的","s":"Some children have an ________ curiosity about science, and they ask questions that even their teachers cannot answer.","zh":"有些孩子對科學有永不滿足的好奇心,他們問的問題連老師都答不出來。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B151","t":"永不滿足"},{"w":"introspection","pos":"n.","def":"careful thinking about your own thoughts and feelings","cn":"內省;自我反省","s":"A little ________ can help you understand your stress, but too much thinking about yourself may make you more anxious.","zh":"一點自我反省能幫助你了解自己的壓力,但過度思考自己可能讓你更焦慮。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B152","t":"自我反省"},{"w":"irrevocable","pos":"adj.","def":"impossible to change or undo","cn":"不可撤銷的;無法挽回的","s":"Choosing a university major is important, but it is not ________, because many students change their major later.","zh":"選擇大學科系很重要,但並非無法挽回,因為許多學生後來會轉系。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B153","t":"無法挽回"},{"w":"latent","pos":"adj.","def":"present but hidden or not yet developed","cn":"潛在的;隱藏的","s":"The drama teacher discovered his ________ talent for acting, and he soon became the star of the school play.","zh":"戲劇老師發掘了他潛在的表演天分,他很快就成了學校話劇的主角。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B154","t":"潛在"},{"w":"mundane","pos":"adj.","def":"ordinary and not interesting","cn":"平凡的;單調的","s":"Even ________ tasks like washing dishes can be relaxing, because they give your mind a break from difficult problems.","zh":"即使像洗碗這樣平凡的家務也能讓人放鬆,因為它們讓你的頭腦暫時擺脫困難的問題。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B155","t":"平凡"},{"w":"novice","pos":"n.","def":"a person who is new to an activity","cn":"新手;初學者","s":"As a ________ at public speaking, Amy felt nervous, but her teacher gave her simple tips that helped a lot.","zh":"身為公開演講的新手,艾咪感到很緊張,但老師給了她一些簡單又很有幫助的訣竅。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B156","t":"新手"},{"w":"oblivious","pos":"adj.","def":"not aware of something","cn":"未察覺的;渾然不覺的","s":"He was ________ to the time while playing his game, so he missed dinner and his mother was not happy.","zh":"他打電動時渾然不覺時間的流逝,所以錯過了晚餐,他媽媽很不高興。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B157","t":"渾然不覺"},{"w":"overt","pos":"adj.","def":"done openly, not secretly","cn":"公開的;明顯的","s":"There were no ________ signs of stress, but her friends noticed that she had stopped eating lunch with them.","zh":"她沒有明顯的壓力跡象,但她的朋友們注意到她不再和他們一起吃午餐了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B158","t":"明顯"},{"w":"palpable","pos":"adj.","def":"so strong that it can almost be felt","cn":"明顯的;可感覺到的","s":"The tension in the exam hall was ________, and nobody spoke while the teacher handed out the papers.","zh":"考場裡的緊張氣氛清晰可感,老師發考卷時沒有人說話。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B159","t":"清晰可感"},{"w":"perpetual","pos":"adj.","def":"never ending; happening again and again","cn":"永久的;不斷的","s":"Living in a state of ________ worry is bad for your health, so learning to relax is an important life skill.","zh":"處於無止盡的擔憂狀態對健康有害,所以學會放鬆是一項重要的生活技能。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B160","t":"無止盡"},{"w":"rejuvenate","pos":"v.","def":"to make someone feel young or energetic again","cn":"使恢復活力","s":"A week by the sea ________ my parents, and they came home smiling and full of new plans.","zh":"在海邊待一週讓我爸媽恢復了活力,他們帶著笑容回家,還充滿新計畫。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B161","t":"恢復了活力"},{"w":"relinquish","pos":"v.","def":"to give up control or a position","cn":"放棄;讓出","s":"The captain decided to ________ his role because of stress, and another player took over the team leadership.","zh":"隊長因為壓力決定放棄他的職位,另一名球員接手了球隊的領導工作。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B162","t":"放棄"},{"w":"remorse","pos":"n.","def":"a strong feeling of being sorry for doing something wrong","cn":"悔恨;懊悔","s":"He felt deep ________ after shouting at his little sister, so he bought her favourite cake to say sorry.","zh":"對妹妹大吼之後他深感懊悔,所以他買了她最愛的蛋糕來道歉。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B163","t":"懊悔"},{"w":"repress","pos":"v.","def":"to stop yourself from showing a feeling","cn":"壓抑","s":"If you always ________ your feelings, they may come out later in unhealthy ways, so it is better to talk about them.","zh":"如果你總是壓抑自己的感受,它們之後可能會以不健康的方式爆發,所以最好說出來。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B164","t":"壓抑"},{"w":"resent","pos":"v.","def":"to feel angry about something unfair","cn":"怨恨;憤慨","s":"Some students ________ group projects because they end up doing most of the work, while others do very little.","zh":"有些學生怨恨小組專題,因為最後大部分工作都是他們在做,而其他人做得很少。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B165","t":"怨恨"},{"w":"respite","pos":"n.","def":"a short rest from something difficult","cn":"暫緩;喘息","s":"The long weekend gave the students a welcome ________ from exams, and many of them spent it with their families.","zh":"連假讓學生們從考試中得到難得的喘息,許多人和家人一起度過。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B166","t":"喘息"},{"w":"revert","pos":"v.","def":"to go back to a previous state or habit","cn":"恢復;回到(原狀)","s":"After the holidays, it is easy to ________ to bad sleeping habits, so try to wake up at the same time every day.","zh":"假期過後很容易回到不好的睡眠習慣,所以試著每天在同一時間起床。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B167","t":"回到"},{"w":"rudimentary","pos":"adj.","def":"very basic","cn":"基本的;初步的","s":"I only have a ________ knowledge of Japanese, but I can order food and ask for directions when I travel.","zh":"我只有基礎的日文知識,但旅行時我能點餐和問路。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B168","t":"基礎的"},{"w":"scrupulous","pos":"adj.","def":"very careful to be honest and correct","cn":"一絲不苟的;嚴謹的","s":"The scientist was ________ about recording every result, so other researchers trusted her findings completely.","zh":"那位科學家對記錄每個結果都一絲不苟,所以其他研究人員完全信任她的發現。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B169","t":"一絲不苟"},{"w":"stifle","pos":"v.","def":"to stop something from developing","cn":"扼殺;抑制","s":"Too many rules can ________ creativity, so the art teacher lets students choose their own topics and materials.","zh":"太多規則會扼殺創造力,所以美術老師讓學生自己選擇主題和材料。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B170","t":"扼殺"},{"w":"succinct","pos":"adj.","def":"clear and short","cn":"簡潔的","s":"Please keep your answers ________ in the interview, because the panel has many candidates to see today.","zh":"面試時請讓你的回答保持簡潔,因為評審團今天要面試很多候選人。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B171","t":"簡潔"},{"w":"superfluous","pos":"adj.","def":"more than is needed","cn":"多餘的","s":"Remove any ________ words from your essay, because clear and simple writing is easier for examiners to read.","zh":"把文章中任何多餘的字刪掉,因為清楚簡單的寫作讓閱卷老師更容易閱讀。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B172","t":"多餘"},{"w":"surmount","pos":"v.","def":"to deal with a difficulty successfully","cn":"克服","s":"With the help of her tutor, she managed to ________ her fear of maths, and she even chose it as her favourite subject later.","zh":"在家教的幫助下,她成功克服了對數學的恐懼,後來甚至把它選為最喜歡的科目。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B173","t":"克服"},{"w":"sway","pos":"v.","def":"to influence someone's opinion or decision","cn":"左右;影響","s":"Advertisements can easily ________ young shoppers, so it is wise to wait a day before buying something expensive.","zh":"廣告很容易左右年輕購物者,所以在買昂貴的東西前先等一天是明智的。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B174","t":"左右"},{"w":"synthesise","pos":"v.","def":"to combine ideas or information into one","cn":"綜合;整合","s":"Good students ________ information from different sources, and they use it to write clear and balanced essays.","zh":"好學生會整合來自不同來源的資訊,並用它寫出清楚而平衡的文章。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B175","t":"整合"},{"w":"tenuous","pos":"adj.","def":"very weak or uncertain","cn":"薄弱的;站不住腳的","s":"The link between the two events was ________, so the teacher asked us to find stronger evidence for our argument.","zh":"這兩件事之間的關聯很薄弱,所以老師要我們為論點找更有力的證據。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B176","t":"薄弱"},{"w":"unfounded","pos":"adj.","def":"not based on facts","cn":"毫無根據的","s":"Her fears about the new school were ________, because the students were friendly and the teachers were very helpful.","zh":"她對新學校的恐懼是毫無根據的,因為同學們很友善,老師們也很樂於幫忙。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B177","t":"毫無根據"},{"w":"unwavering","pos":"adj.","def":"not changing or becoming weaker","cn":"堅定不移的","s":"The team's ________ belief in their coach helped them through a difficult season, and they finally won the cup.","zh":"球隊對教練堅定不移的信任幫助他們度過艱難的球季,最後他們贏得了冠軍。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B178","t":"堅定不移"},{"w":"accustomed","pos":"adj.","def":"used to something","cn":"習慣於……的","s":"It took me a month to get ________ to waking up early, but now I enjoy the quiet time before school.","zh":"我花了一個月才習慣早起,但現在我很享受上學前的安靜時光。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B179","t":"習慣"},{"w":"discourage","pos":"v.","def":"to make someone lose confidence or not want to do something","cn":"使灰心;勸阻","s":"Don't let one bad score ________ you, because every learner has difficult days and you can still improve.","zh":"不要讓一次糟糕的分數使你灰心,因為每個學習者都有不順的日子,而你仍然可以進步。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B180","t":"使你灰心"},{"w":"dismay","pos":"n.","def":"a feeling of shock and disappointment","cn":"驚愕;沮喪","s":"To her ________, the bus left just as she arrived, so she had to wait thirty minutes in the rain.","zh":"令她沮喪的是,她一到公車就開走了,所以她只好在雨中等了三十分鐘。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B181","t":"沮喪"},{"w":"fervent","pos":"adj.","def":"having very strong feelings about something","cn":"熱烈的;熱切的","s":"My cousin is a ________ supporter of the local team, and he goes to every home game even when it rains.","zh":"我表哥是當地球隊的狂熱支持者,即使下雨他也去看每一場主場比賽。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B182","t":"狂熱"},{"w":"foremost","pos":"adj.","def":"most important","cn":"最重要的;首要的","s":"Your health should be your ________ concern, and no exam result is worth losing sleep for weeks.","zh":"你的健康應該是你最重要的考量,沒有任何考試成績值得讓你連續好幾週失眠。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B183","t":"最重要的"},{"w":"fortitude","pos":"n.","def":"courage in pain or difficulty","cn":"堅毅;剛毅","s":"The patient faced her long treatment with great ________, and she always smiled at the nurses.","zh":"那位病人以極大的堅毅面對漫長的治療,她總是對護理師們微笑。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B184","t":"堅毅"},{"w":"inquisitive","pos":"adj.","def":"wanting to learn and ask questions","cn":"好奇的;好問的","s":"________ students often learn faster, because they ask questions until they really understand the topic.","zh":"好問的學生通常學得比較快,因為他們會一直提問直到真正理解主題。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B185","t":"好問"},{"w":"notorious","pos":"adj.","def":"famous for something bad","cn":"惡名昭彰的;出了名(不好)的","s":"This road is ________ for traffic jams, so my father leaves home very early to avoid being late for work.","zh":"這條路以塞車出了名,所以我爸爸很早出門以免上班遲到。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B186","t":"出了名"},{"w":"plight","pos":"n.","def":"a difficult or sad situation","cn":"困境","s":"The news story about the ________ of overworked delivery drivers made many people tip them more generously.","zh":"關於過勞外送員困境的新聞報導,讓許多人更慷慨地給他們小費。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B187","t":"困境"},{"w":"relish","pos":"v.","def":"to enjoy something very much","cn":"享受;喜愛","s":"Some people ________ a challenge, and they feel more excited than nervous before an important game.","zh":"有些人享受挑戰,在重要比賽前他們感到的是興奮多於緊張。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B188","t":"享受"},{"w":"resolute","pos":"adj.","def":"determined and not willing to change","cn":"堅決的;果斷的","s":"She was ________ in her plan to run a marathon, so she trained every morning, even in the cold winter.","zh":"她對跑馬拉松的計畫非常堅決,所以即使在寒冷的冬天她每天早上都訓練。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B189","t":"堅決"},{"w":"tactic","pos":"n.","def":"a method used to achieve something","cn":"策略;手法","s":"One useful ________ for exams is to answer the easy questions first, so you build confidence before the hard ones.","zh":"考試的一個實用策略是先回答簡單的題目,這樣在面對難題前你就能建立信心。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B190","t":"策略"},{"w":"unpredictable","pos":"adj.","def":"changing in a way that is hard to guess","cn":"難以預測的","s":"The weather in the mountains is ________, so you should always bring a raincoat, even on a sunny morning.","zh":"山上的天氣難以預測,所以即使是晴朗的早晨,你也應該隨身帶雨衣。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B191","t":"難以預測"},{"w":"vague","pos":"adj.","def":"not clear or detailed","cn":"模糊的;含糊的","s":"My goals were too ________ last year, so this year I wrote specific plans with dates and small steps.","zh":"我去年的目標太模糊了,所以今年我寫下了有日期和小步驟的具體計畫。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B192","t":"模糊"},{"w":"worthwhile","pos":"adj.","def":"worth the time, money or effort","cn":"值得的","s":"Learning to manage stress is ________, because it will help you in school, at work and in your relationships.","zh":"學習管理壓力是值得的,因為它會在學業、工作和人際關係中幫助你。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B193","t":"值得的"},{"w":"stamina","pos":"n.","def":"the energy to keep doing something for a long time","cn":"耐力;精力","s":"Long exams require mental ________, so students should practise with full-length tests before the real exam.","zh":"長時間的考試需要心理上的耐力,所以學生在正式考試前應該用完整長度的測驗練習。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B194","t":"耐力"},{"w":"vitality","pos":"n.","def":"energy and liveliness","cn":"活力","s":"Regular exercise gives older people more ________, and many of them say they feel ten years younger.","zh":"規律運動讓年長者更有活力,許多人說他們覺得自己年輕了十歲。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B195","t":"活力"},{"w":"mentality","pos":"n.","def":"a typical way of thinking","cn":"心態;思維模式","s":"A winning ________ helps athletes stay calm under pressure, but they also need good training and rest.","zh":"贏家心態幫助運動員在壓力下保持冷靜,但他們也需要良好的訓練和休息。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B196","t":"心態"},{"w":"reminiscent","pos":"adj.","def":"making you think of something in the past","cn":"使人聯想起……的","s":"The smell of the new classroom was ________ of my first day at primary school, and it made me feel a little nervous.","zh":"新教室的氣味讓我聯想起小學第一天上學,這讓我感到有點緊張。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B197","t":"聯想起"},{"w":"reproach","pos":"v.","def":"to criticise someone, often gently","cn":"責備","s":"Don't ________ yourself for every small mistake, because being kind to yourself makes it easier to improve.","zh":"不要為每個小錯誤責備自己,因為善待自己會讓進步變得更容易。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B198","t":"責備"},{"w":"compulsory","pos":"adj.","def":"required by law or rules","cn":"義務的;強制的","s":"Physical education is ________ in most schools, and it gives students a healthy break from sitting in class.","zh":"體育課在大多數學校是必修的,它讓學生從久坐的課堂中得到健康的休息。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B199","t":"必修的"},{"w":"lucid","pos":"adj.","def":"clear and easy to understand","cn":"清晰易懂的","s":"The teacher gave a ________ explanation of the grammar rule, so even the weakest students could follow it.","zh":"老師對這個文法規則做了清晰易懂的解釋,所以連程度最弱的學生都能理解。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B200","t":"清晰易懂"},{"w":"under pressure","pos":"adj.phr.","def":"feeling stressed because of demands","cn":"承受壓力","s":"Many students perform badly ______ ______, so teachers give them practice tests to make the real exam feel familiar.","zh":"許多學生在壓力下表現不佳,所以老師讓他們做模擬考,使正式考試感覺比較熟悉。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P1","t":"壓力下"},{"w":"stressed out","pos":"adj.phr.","def":"very worried and tense","cn":"壓力很大的","s":"I was so ______ ______ before my final exams that I could not sleep, so my mum made me a cup of warm milk.","zh":"期末考前我壓力大到睡不著,所以媽媽幫我泡了一杯熱牛奶。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P2","t":"壓力大到"},{"w":"burn the midnight oil","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to work or study late at night","cn":"熬夜工作或讀書","s":"Jason had to ______ ______ ______ ______ to finish his project, and he looked very tired in class the next morning.","zh":"傑森必須熬夜苦讀才能完成他的專題,隔天早上他在課堂上看起來非常疲倦。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P3","t":"熬夜苦讀"},{"w":"keep one's cool","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to stay calm in a difficult situation","cn":"保持冷靜","s":"The pilot ______ ______ ______ when the engine failed, and she landed the plane safely in a nearby field.","zh":"引擎故障時那位機長保持冷靜,並把飛機安全降落在附近的田野上。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P4","t":"保持冷靜"},{"w":"lose one's temper","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to suddenly become very angry","cn":"發脾氣","s":"My father rarely ______ ______ ______, but he shouted when my brother broke the window for the second time.","zh":"我爸爸很少發脾氣,但我弟弟第二次打破窗戶時他大吼了。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P5","t":"發脾氣"},{"w":"put off","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to delay doing something","cn":"拖延;延後","s":"I always ______ ______ cleaning my room until the weekend, and by then it is so messy that it takes hours.","zh":"我總是把打掃房間拖延到週末,到那時房間亂到要花好幾個小時才能整理好。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P6","t":"拖延"},{"w":"let off steam","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to release strong feelings or energy","cn":"發洩情緒或精力","s":"After a long day of exams, the students played basketball to ______ ______ ______, and they all felt better afterwards.","zh":"經過一整天的考試,學生們打籃球來發洩情緒,之後大家都覺得好多了。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P7","t":"發洩情緒"},{"w":"bite off more than one can chew","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to try to do more than you are able to","cn":"貪多嚼不爛;不自量力","s":"Lucy joined four clubs this term, but she ______ ______ ______ ______ ______ ______ ______, so she quit two of them.","zh":"露西這學期參加了四個社團,但她貪多嚼不爛,所以退出了其中兩個。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P8","t":"貪多嚼不爛"},{"w":"sit on the fence","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to avoid choosing between two sides","cn":"保持中立;騎牆觀望","s":"You can't ______ ______ ______ ______ forever, because the team needs your vote before we can start the project.","zh":"你不能永遠騎牆觀望,因為我們開始專題之前,團隊需要你投下一票。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P9","t":"騎牆觀望"},{"w":"make up one's mind","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to decide","cn":"下定決心;做決定","s":"I couldn't ______ ______ ______ ______ about which dress to buy, so I asked my sister to choose for me.","zh":"我無法決定要買哪件洋裝,所以我請姊姊幫我選。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P10","t":"決定"},{"w":"sleep on it","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to wait until the next day before deciding","cn":"考慮一晚再決定","s":"The job offer sounded exciting, but my mother told me to ______ ______ ______ before I gave the company an answer.","zh":"那份工作邀約聽起來很令人興奮,但媽媽叫我先考慮一晚再給公司答覆。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P11","t":"先考慮一晚"},{"w":"go with one's gut","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to make a decision based on feelings","cn":"憑直覺行事","s":"When you are not sure of an answer, it is often best to ______ ______ ______ ______, because your first idea is usually right.","zh":"當你不確定答案時,憑直覺通常是最好的,因為你的第一個想法往往是對的。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P12","t":"憑直覺"},{"w":"have second thoughts","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to start to doubt a decision","cn":"改變主意;猶豫","s":"Mark agreed to sing at the concert, but he began to ______ ______ ______ when he saw how big the audience was.","zh":"馬克答應在音樂會上唱歌,但當他看到觀眾有多少時,他開始猶豫要不要改變主意。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P13","t":"猶豫要不要改變主意"},{"w":"jump to conclusions","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to decide something is true too quickly","cn":"妄下結論","s":"Don't ______ ______ ______ when a friend does not reply quickly, because they may simply be busy with homework.","zh":"朋友沒有很快回覆時不要妄下結論,因為他們可能只是在忙作業。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P14","t":"妄下結論"},{"w":"go the extra mile","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to make more effort than is expected","cn":"加倍努力;多付出一些","s":"Our English teacher always ______ ______ ______ ______ for her students, and she even stays after school to answer questions.","zh":"我們的英文老師總是為學生加倍付出,她甚至放學後留下來回答問題。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P15","t":"加倍付出"},{"w":"light at the end of the tunnel","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a sign that a difficult time will end soon","cn":"黑暗盡頭的曙光;苦盡甘來的希望","s":"Exams finish next Friday, so we can finally see the ______ ______ ______ ______ ______ ______ ______, and we are planning a party.","zh":"考試下週五結束,所以我們終於看到了隧道盡頭的曙光,我們正在計畫辦派對。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P16","t":"隧道盡頭的曙光"},{"w":"take it easy","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to relax and not work too hard","cn":"放輕鬆;別太累","s":"The doctor told my mother to ______ ______ ______ for a week, so we all helped with the cooking and cleaning.","zh":"醫生叫我媽媽好好休息一週,所以我們大家都幫忙煮飯和打掃。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P17","t":"好好休息"},{"w":"a weight off one's shoulders","pos":"n.phr.","def":"relief from a worry or responsibility","cn":"如釋重負","s":"Handing in my final report was ______ ______ ______ ______ ______, and I slept for ten hours that night.","zh":"交出期末報告讓我如釋重負,那天晚上我睡了十個小時。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P18","t":"如釋重負"},{"w":"get cold feet","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to suddenly feel too nervous to do something you planned","cn":"臨陣退縮","s":"Tina planned to try out for the school play, but she ______ ______ ______ at the last moment and stayed home.","zh":"蒂娜原本打算參加學校話劇的試鏡,但她在最後一刻臨陣退縮,待在家裡。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P19","t":"臨陣退縮"},{"w":"at the end of one's tether","pos":"adj.phr.","def":"so tired or upset that you cannot cope any more","cn":"束手無策;忍無可忍","s":"After a week of noisy neighbours and little sleep, I was ______ ______ ______ ______ ______ ______, so I asked them politely to be quiet.","zh":"經過一週吵鬧的鄰居和很少的睡眠,我已經忍無可忍,所以我禮貌地請他們安靜一點。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P20","t":"忍無可忍"}]};
